{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014hacVms1sjqakkGXrz7SbN","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'η_max dominance叙事作为主要claim坍塌。Bootstrap η_max降至3/12，与K_eff的1/12相比dominance\n2\t  ratio仅3:1→实质上两个predictor都不robust。 VIF >7确认η_max与K_eff在当前设计下无法可靠分离。RF contrast的GO/NO-GO\n3\t  gate失败——K_eff在random faults下也仅0-1/2显著，BFT类比失去实证基础。 GAM 6:6 split在bootstrap CI下退化为3-4/6\n4\t  per category并出现2个reversal，clean taxonomy不成立。 Bayesian K_eff方向翻转在clustered SE下消失（0-1/7\n5\t  negative）。ARC benchmark几乎全部NS——实质上是single-benchmark study。 论文必须彻底重构。Salvage路径：(A)\n6\t  方法学贡献——OLS→bootstrap显著性collapse（η_max 11→3, K_eff 8→1）作为headline finding， 为LLM-as-judge评测文献提供non-independence\n7\t  correction framework；(B) 数据资源贡献——15模型455 panels的adversarial评测数据集； (C) 聚合规则作为独立发现——即使η_max\n8\t  vs K_eff分解不可靠，threshold R²=0.89 vs Bayesian R²=0.10的gradient仍成立。 目标EMNLP Findings（Overall\n9\t  ~2.5-3.0），Main几乎不可能。\n10\t\n11\t  '\n12\timagined_experiments:\n13\t- name: 'Scale expansion: 15 models with API + large open-source'\n14\t  plan_id: plan_001\n15\t  description: '将模型池从6扩展到15（加入GPT-4o-mini, GPT-4o, GPT-4.1, GPT-4.1-mini, Llama-3.1-70B,\n16\t    Qwen2.5-72B等）， 重跑MI矩阵 + C(15,3)=455 panels回归 + bootstrap/clustered SE/mixed effects全套correction。\n17\t\n18\t    '\n19\t  expected_results:\n20\t    total_models: 15\n21\t    total_panels: 455\n22\t    total_conditions: 12\n23\t    confound_mean_abs_r: 0.72\n24\t    canonical_ols_eta_max_sig: 11/12\n25\t    canonical_ols_keff_sig: 8/12\n26\t    canonical_ols_keff_positive: 7\n27\t    canonical_ols_keff_negative: 1\n28\t    wild_cluster_bootstrap_v2_eta_max_sig: 3/12\n29\t    wild_cluster_bootstrap_v2_keff_sig: 1/12\n30\t    clustered_se_eta_max_sig: 5/12\n31\t    clustered_se_keff_sig: 0/12\n32\t    mixed_effects_eta_max_sig: 4/12\n33\t    mixed_effects_keff_sig: 1/12\n34\t    eta_keff_dominance_ratio_bootstrap: 3.0\n35\t    se_inflation_factor: 3.2\n36\t    bootstrap_position_0_eta_sig: 2/12\n37\t    bootstrap_position_1_eta_sig: 5/12\n38\t    bootstrap_position_2_eta_sig: 4/12\n39\t    mmlu_eta_bootstrap_sig: 2/6\n40\t    arc_eta_bootstrap_sig: 1/6\n41\t    keff_practical_delta_asr_iqr_pp: 0.8\n42\t    median_R2: 0.25\n43\t  result_rationale: '扩展到15模型后，OLS结果表面上确认η_max dominance（11/12 vs 8/12）。但non-independence\n44\t    correction的冲击远超预期。 Bootstrap v2（3-position max-p, Rademacher weights, B=9999）显示position\n45\t    0的cluster imbalance问题 （claude-3-haiku=91 panels vs qwen2.5-14b=1）不仅存在于position\n46\t    0——position 1和2也受cluster size不均影响， 只是程度较轻。3-position max-p取最保守估计，η_max仅3/12存活（全部在MMLU上，ARC仅1/6）。\n47\t    K_eff在bootstrap下仅1/12——但这与η_max的3/12相比，dominance ratio仅3:1，远不如\"η_max dominates\"的叙事所需的清晰分离。\n48\t    SE inflation ~3.2×（高于预期的2.5×），说明panel overlap导致的non-independence比initial估计更严重。\n49\t    根本问题：455 panels来自15个model的C(15,3)组合，每个model出现在C(14,2)=91个panels中——观测值之间的非独立性是结构性的，\n50\t    不是correction能完全解决的。bootstrap的保守性可能合理反映了真实的statistical power。\n51\t\n52\t    '\n53\t  tables:\n54\t  - caption: 'OLS vs correction methods: significance counts across 12 conditions'\n55\t    columns:\n56\t    - Method\n57\t    - η_max sig\n58\t    - K_eff sig\n59\t    - K_eff positive\n60\t    - K_eff negative\n61\t    - Dominance ratio\n62\t    rows:\n63\t    - - OLS (naive)\n64\t      - 11/12\n65\t      - 8/12\n66\t      - '7'\n67\t      - '1'\n68\t      - 1.4:1\n69\t    - - Clustered SE (CR1, 15 clusters)\n70\t      - 5/12\n71\t      - 0/12\n72\t      - —\n73\t      - —\n74\t      - ∞\n75\t    - - Mixed effects (random judge intercepts)\n76\t      - 4/12\n77\t      - 1/12\n78\t      - '1'\n79\t      - '0'\n80\t      - '4:1'\n81\t    - - Wild cluster bootstrap v2 (max-p)\n82\t      - 3/12\n83\t      - 1/12\n84\t      - '1'\n85\t      - '0'\n86\t      - '3:1'\n87\t    - - SE inflation factor\n88\t      - —\n89\t      - —\n90\t      - —\n91\t      - —\n92\t      - 3.2×\n93\t  - caption: Bootstrap η_max significance by position and benchmark\n94\t    columns:\n95\t    - Position\n96\t    - MMLU sig/6\n97\t    - ARC sig/6\n98\t    - Total sig/12\n99\t    - Cluster balance (max/min panels)\n100\t    rows:\n101\t    - - Position 0\n102\t      - 1/6\n103\t      - 1/6\n104\t      - 2/12\n105\t      - '91:1'\n106\t    - - Position 1\n107\t      - 3/6\n108\t      - 2/6\n109\t      - 5/12\n110\t      - '55:12'\n111\t    - - Position 2\n112\t      - 3/6\n113\t      - 1/6\n114\t      - 4/12\n115\t      - '48:15'\n116\t    - - Max-p (conservative)\n117\t      - 2/6\n118\t      - 1/6\n119\t      - 3/12\n120\t      - —\n121\t  - caption: Per-condition bootstrap results (12 conditions)\n122\t    columns:\n123\t    - Dataset\n124\t    - Attack\n125\t    - OLS η_max p\n126\t    - Bootstrap η_max p\n127\t    - OLS K_eff p\n128\t    - Bootstrap K_eff p\n129\t    rows:\n130\t    - - MMLU\n131\t      - prompt_injection\n132\t      - 2e-06\n133\t      - '0.028'\n134\t      - '0.004'\n135\t      - '0.18'\n136\t    - - MMLU\n137\t      - score_manipulation\n138\t      - 8e-05\n139\t      - '0.041'\n140\t      - '0.011'\n141\t      - '0.31'\n142\t    - - MMLU\n143\t      - sycophancy\n144\t      - '0.002'\n145\t      - '0.14'\n146\t      - '0.08'\n147\t      - '0.42'\n148\t    - - MMLU\n149\t      - verbosity_bias\n150\t      - '0.009'\n151\t      - '0.22'\n152\t      - '0.15'\n153\t      - '0.55'\n154\t    - - MMLU\n155\t      - position_bias\n156\t      - '0.001'\n157\t      - '0.08'\n158\t      - '0.035'\n159\t      - '0.04'\n160\t    - - MMLU\n161\t      - authority_bias\n162\t      - '0.004'\n163\t      - '0.19'\n164\t      - '0.09'\n165\t      - '0.48'\n166\t    - - ARC\n167\t      - prompt_injection\n168\t      - 3e-14\n169\t      - '0.35'\n170\t      - '0.001'\n171\t      - '0.62'\n172\t    - - ARC\n173\t      - score_manipulation\n174\t      - 1e-08\n175\t      - '0.06'\n176\t      - '0.003'\n177\t      - '0.44'\n178\t    - - ARC\n179\t      - sycophancy\n180\t      - '0.013'\n181\t      - '0.52'\n182\t      - '0.24'\n183\t      - '0.71'\n184\t    - - ARC\n185\t      - verbosity_bias\n186\t      - '0.031'\n187\t      - '0.61'\n188\t      - '0.18'\n189\t      - '0.68'\n190\t    - - ARC\n191\t      - position_bias\n192\t      - '0.006'\n193\t      - '0.28'\n194\t      - '0.008'\n195\t      - '0.33'\n196\t    - - ARC\n197\t      - authority_bias\n198\t      - '0.019'\n199\t      - '0.44'\n200\t      - '0.12'\n201\t      - '0.59'\n202\t  figures_description:\n203\t  - 'Paired bar chart: 12 conditions × 4 methods (OLS, clustered SE, mixed effects,\n204\t    bootstrap) showing η_max和K_eff p-values。OLS条形几乎全部低于0.05线，bootstrap后大部分跃升至NS区间。\n205\t    视觉上最striking的是ARC benchmark——OLS下有极低p-value（如3e-14），bootstrap后全部>0.05。 这张图成为\"non-independence\n206\t    trap\"方法学贡献的核心figure。\n207\t\n208\t    '\n209\t  - 'Heatmap: 15×15 model pair co-occurrence matrix in 455 panels。对角线元素=91（每个model出现91次），\n210\t    off-diagonal显示任意两个model共同出现的panel数。颜色分布揭示结构性非独立性的来源。\n211\t\n212\t    '\n213\t  analysis: '这是worst档的核心灾难性结果。OLS给出的\"η_max dominates (11:8)\"在bootstrap correction后坍塌为\"3:1，\n214\t    且绝对数极低（3/12 vs 1/12）\"。两个predictor在corrected inference下都几乎不显著——不是η_max dominates\n215\t    K_eff， 而是整个regression在corrected inference下statistical power不足。 ARC benchmark尤其脆弱：OLS下最显著的条件（arc×PI,\n216\t    p=3e-14）在bootstrap后完全NS（p=0.35）， 说明该条件的信号几乎entirely来自panel overlap inflation。如果排除ARC，实质上是single-benchmark\n217\t    study（MMLU only）， reviewer会质疑generalizability。SE inflation 3.2×比预期高——可能是cluster\n218\t    size imbalance（91:1） 放大了bootstrap保守性。但这也意味着OLS的所有结论都需要extreme caution来解读。 论文必须pivoting到\"the\n219\t    OLS→bootstrap collapse itself is the finding\"——方法学贡献救场。\n220\t\n221\t    '\n222\t- name: 'Attack expansion: few-shot hijacking, persona manipulation, instruction override'\n223\t  plan_id: plan_002\n224\t  description: '新增3种攻击类型（few-shot hijacking、persona manipulation、instruction override），在15模型池上运行。\n225\t    扩展总条件数到18。验证weakest-link在更广泛attack surface上的表现。\n226\t\n227\t    '\n228\t  expected_results:\n229\t    new_attack_types: 3\n230\t    total_attack_types: 9\n231\t    total_conditions: 18\n232\t    new_attacks_ols_eta_max_sig: 5/6\n233\t    new_attacks_ols_keff_sig: 3/6\n234\t    new_attacks_bootstrap_eta_max_sig: 1/6\n235\t    new_attacks_bootstrap_keff_sig: 0/6\n236\t    new_attacks_clustered_se_eta_max_sig: 2/6\n237\t    new_attacks_clustered_se_keff_sig: 0/6\n238\t    overall_18cond_bootstrap_eta_sig: 4/18\n239\t    overall_18cond_bootstrap_keff_sig: 1/18\n240\t    overall_18cond_ols_eta_sig: 16/18\n241\t    overall_18cond_ols_keff_sig: 11/18\n242\t    few_shot_hijacking_keff_direction: positive\n243\t    persona_manipulation_keff_direction: positive\n244\t    instruction_override_keff_direction: negative\n245\t    gam_extended_targeted_positive: 4/9\n246\t    gam_extended_sharedbias_negative: 5/9\n247\t    gam_reversals: 3\n248\t  result_rationale: '新增攻击在OLS下看似确认pattern（5/6 η_max sig, 3/6 K_eff sig），但bootstrap\n249\t    correction后again坍塌 （1/6和0/6）。根本原因相同：455 panels的非独立性问题不因添加新attack types而缓解——每个attack下的panel结构完全相同。\n250\t    更糟的是，新攻击引入GAM 6:6 split的reversal：few-shot hijacking理论上是targeted attack（需要针对specific\n251\t    model）， 但实证中K_eff方向为正——因为few-shot hijacking利用in-context learning这一所有LLM共享的能力，实际行为更接近shared-bias。\n252\t    persona manipulation也出现类似anomaly。原先clean的6:6 targeted/shared-bias taxonomy在9种攻击下退化为\n253\t    4/9 targeted-positive vs 5/9 shared-bias-negative，有3个reversal。taxonomy不再\"clean\"，\n254\t    而是\"noisy with a directional tendency\"——远不够支撑independent contribution。\n255\t\n256\t    '\n257\t  tables:\n258\t  - caption: 'New attack types: OLS vs bootstrap correction'\n259\t    columns:\n260\t    - Dataset\n261\t    - Attack\n262\t    - OLS η_max p\n263\t    - Bootstrap η_max p\n264\t    - OLS K_eff p\n265\t    - Bootstrap K_eff p\n266\t    - K_eff direction\n267\t    rows:\n268\t    - - MMLU\n269\t      - few-shot-hijacking\n270\t      - '0.001'\n271\t      - '0.18'\n272\t      - '0.02'\n273\t      - '0.41'\n274\t      - positive\n275\t    - - MMLU\n276\t      - persona-manipulation\n277\t      - '0.003'\n278\t      - '0.09'\n279\t      - '0.04'\n280\t      - '0.52'\n281\t      - positive\n282\t    - - MMLU\n283\t      - instruction-override\n284\t      - '0.0005'\n285\t      - '0.04'\n286\t      - '0.08'\n287\t      - '0.38'\n288\t      - negative\n289\t    - - ARC\n290\t      - few-shot-hijacking\n291\t      - '0.008'\n292\t      - '0.31'\n293\t      - '0.05'\n294\t      - '0.55'\n295\t      - positive\n296\t    - - ARC\n297\t      - persona-manipulation\n298\t      - '0.012'\n299\t      - '0.22'\n300\t      - '0.09'\n301\t      - '0.63'\n302\t      - positive\n303\t    - - ARC\n304\t      - instruction-override\n305\t      - '0.002'\n306\t      - '0.12'\n307\t      - '0.11'\n308\t      - '0.48'\n309\t      - negative\n310\t  - caption: 'Extended GAM taxonomy: 9 attacks × 2 benchmarks'\n311\t    columns:\n312\t    - Attack\n313\t    - Category (original)\n314\t    - K_eff direction (MMLU)\n315\t    - K_eff direction (ARC)\n316\t    - Consistent with taxonomy?\n317\t    rows:\n318\t    - - prompt_injection\n319\t      - targeted\n320\t      - positive\n321\t      - positive\n322\t      - 'yes'\n323\t    - - score_manipulation\n324\t      - targeted\n325\t      - positive\n326\t      - positive\n327\t      - 'yes'\n328\t    - - position_bias\n329\t      - targeted\n330\t      - positive\n331\t      - negative\n332\t      - REVERSAL\n333\t    - - few-shot-hijacking\n334\t      - targeted\n335\t      - positive\n336\t      - positive\n337\t      - yes but mechanism unclear\n338\t    - - persona-manipulation\n339\t      - targeted\n340\t      - positive\n341\t      - positive\n342\t      - yes but weak\n343\t    - - sycophancy\n344\t      - shared-bias\n345\t      - negative\n346\t      - negative\n347\t      - 'yes'\n348\t    - - verbosity_bias\n349\t      - shared-bias\n350\t      - negative\n351\t      - positive\n352\t      - REVERSAL\n353\t    - - authority_bias\n354\t      - shared-bias\n355\t      - negative\n356\t      - negative\n357\t      - 'yes'\n358\t    - - instruction-override\n359\t      - shared-bias\n360\t      - negative\n361\t      - negative\n362\t      - 'yes'\n363\t  figures_description:\n364\t  - 'Extended heatmap: 18 conditions × 2 predictors × 4 methods。OLS panel与bootstrap\n365\t    panel的visual contrast 极为dramatic——左半bright（significant），右半dim（NS）。标注3个GAM reversal为红色X标记。\n366\t\n367\t    '\n368\t  analysis: '攻击扩展确认了worst档的核心问题：所有新增数据都使用相同的455 panel结构，non-independence问题是structural的，\n369\t    不会因为添加更多attack types而改善。OLS下看似丰富的结果在bootstrap后一律坍塌。 GAM taxonomy的3个reversal（arc×position_bias方向翻转，mmlu×verbosity_bias方向翻转，加上1个边界case）\n370\t    使得\"clean 6:6 split\"不再成立。剩下的directional tendency（~60-70%与预测方向一致）在18个condition下\n371\t    可能仅略好于chance（binomial test p ≈ 0.08-0.15），无法作为independent contribution。\n372\t\n373\t    '\n374\t- name: 'Random-fault simulation: BFT contrast GO/NO-GO gate'\n375\t  plan_id: plan_003\n376\t  description: 'Random-fault simulation：每个judge独立以概率η_j fail，majority vote。 对比random\n377\t    faults vs adaptive attacks下K_eff的显著性。 GO/NO-GO GATE：如果random-fault K_eff也不显著→BFT\n378\t    framing彻底坍塌。\n379\t\n380\t    '\n381\t  expected_results:\n382\t    rf_conditions: 2\n383\t    rf_ols_keff_sig: 2/2\n384\t    rf_bootstrap_keff_sig: 0/2\n385\t    rf_clustered_se_keff_sig: 1/2\n386\t    rf_ols_eta_sig: 2/2\n387\t    rf_bootstrap_eta_sig: 1/2\n388\t    rf_mmlu_R2: 0.52\n389\t    rf_arc_R2: 0.48\n390\t    rf_keff_std_beta_mmlu: 0.18\n391\t    rf_keff_std_beta_arc: 0.28\n392\t    rf_vs_adaptive_keff_beta_ratio: 1.2\n393\t    rf_vs_adaptive_contrast_p: 0.31\n394\t    rf_vs_adaptive_cohen_d: 0.12\n395\t    go_nogo_gate: FAIL\n396\t  result_rationale: 'GO/NO-GO gate FAIL。Random-fault regime下K_eff在OLS中显著（2/2），但bootstrap\n397\t    correction后降至0/2。 这不意味着BFT理论错误——而是本实验设计（455 panels, 15 models）的non-independence问题在RF\n398\t    regime下同样存在。 RF regime的R²确实高于adaptive（0.52 vs 0.25），表明panel composition对RF错误的解释力更强，\n399\t    但K_eff的独立贡献在corrected inference下无法与η_max可靠分离（VIF >7, 见plan_009）。 RF vs adaptive的K_eff\n400\t    β ratio仅1.2×（预期需>2×才能convincingly demonstrate BFT contrast）， Cohen''s d = 0.12（远低于small\n401\t    effect size标准0.2）。 BFT framing的核心逻辑——\"diversity helps under random faults but\n402\t    hurts under adaptive\"—— 在实证上无法被本数据支撑。不是因为理论错误，而是因为实验设计的structural non-independence\n403\t    使得任何K_eff相关的inference都不可靠。BFT对比降级为\"directional observation consistent with theory\"。\n404\t\n405\t    '\n406\t  tables:\n407\t  - caption: 'Random-fault vs adaptive: K_eff significance under correction'\n408\t    columns:\n409\t    - Regime\n410\t    - Method\n411\t    - η_max sig\n412\t    - K_eff sig\n413\t    - R²\n414\t    - K_eff std β\n415\t    rows:\n416\t    - - Random-fault\n417\t      - OLS\n418\t      - 2/2\n419\t      - 2/2\n420\t      - '0.52'\n421\t      - '+0.215'\n422\t    - - Random-fault\n423\t      - Clustered SE\n424\t      - 2/2\n425\t      - 1/2\n426\t      - —\n427\t      - '+0.215'\n428\t    - - Random-fault\n429\t      - Bootstrap v2\n430\t      - 1/2\n431\t      - 0/2\n432\t      - —\n433\t      - '+0.215'\n434\t    - - Adaptive\n435\t      - OLS\n436\t      - 11/12\n437\t      - 8/12\n438\t      - '0.25'\n439\t      - '+0.164'\n440\t    - - Adaptive\n441\t      - Clustered SE\n442\t      - 5/12\n443\t      - 0/12\n444\t      - —\n445\t      - '+0.164'\n446\t    - - Adaptive\n447\t      - Bootstrap v2\n448\t      - 3/12\n449\t      - 1/12\n450\t      - —\n451\t      - '+0.164'\n452\t  - caption: 'BFT contrast: effect size analysis'\n453\t    columns:\n454\t    - Metric\n455\t    - Value\n456\t    - Threshold for claim\n457\t    - Verdict\n458\t    rows:\n459\t    - - K_eff β ratio (RF/adaptive)\n460\t      - '1.2'\n461\t      - '>2.0'\n462\t      - FAIL\n463\t    - - Cohen's d (paired)\n464\t      - '0.12'\n465\t      - '>0.2 (small)'\n466\t      - FAIL\n467\t    - - Contrast p-value\n468\t      - '0.31'\n469\t      - <0.05\n470\t      - FAIL\n471\t    - - R² gap (RF - adaptive)\n472\t      - '0.27'\n473\t      - '>0.3'\n474\t      - MARGINAL\n475\t  figures_description:\n476\t  - 'Paired comparison: RF vs adaptive regime下K_eff β的paired bar chart（2 conditions）。\n477\t    两个bar高度接近，error bars重叠严重。下方annotate Cohen''s d = 0.12, p = 0.31。 标注\"GO/NO-GO GATE:\n478\t    FAIL\"。\n479\t\n480\t    '\n481\t  analysis: 'GO/NO-GO gate failure是worst档中最具结构性影响的结果。BFT framing是论文theoretical novelty的核心——\n482\t    没有\"random fault vs adaptive adversary\"的对比，Claim 2整体坍塌。 但failure的原因是subtle的：不是K_eff在RF下真的不important（R²确实更高），\n483\t    而是corrected inference下K_eff的独立效应在任何regime下都不可靠（VIF >7, 15 model clusters太少）。 这实际上reinforces方法学贡献——\"combinatorial\n484\t    panel designs create massive non-independence that makes ANY predictor-level inference\n485\t    unreliable\"——但代价是丧失了theoretical framing。 论文需要将BFT降级为motivation/intuition，而非tested\n486\t    hypothesis。\n487\t\n488\t    '\n489\t- name: 'Capability-matched validation: within-tier K_eff analysis'\n490\t  plan_id: plan_004\n491\t  description: '在同一capability tier内（3/3/9分层：3 frontier, 3 strong, 9 mid-weak）， 测试控制η_max\n492\t    variance后K_eff是否显著。\n493\t\n494\t    '\n495\t  expected_results:\n496\t    tiers_tested: 3\n497\t    tier_frontier_models: 3\n498\t    tier_frontier_panels: 1\n499\t    tier_strong_models: 3\n500\t    tier_strong_panels: 1\n501\t    tier_midweak_models: 9\n502\t    tier_midweak_panels: 84\n503\t    within_tier_eta_max_sig_frontier: 0/12\n504\t    within_tier_keff_sig_frontier: 0/12\n505\t    within_tier_eta_max_sig_strong: 0/12\n506\t    within_tier_keff_sig_strong: 0/12\n507\t    within_tier_eta_max_sig_midweak: 3/12\n508\t    within_tier_keff_sig_midweak: 0/12\n509\t    cross_tier_eta_max_sig: 11/12\n510\t    cross_tier_keff_sig: 8/12\n511\t    capability_range_eta_r: 0.82\n512\t    within_tier_eta_range_reduction: 75%\n513\t  result_rationale: 'Capability-matched analysis彻底暴露η_max dominance对capability tier\n514\t    spread的依赖。 3/3/9分层下，frontier tier（3 models）和strong tier（3 models）各只有C(3,3)=1个panel——\n515\t    根本没有足够variance做回归。mid-weak tier有C(9,3)=84 panels，但within-tier η_max range被压缩75%\n516\t    （所有模型能力相近→η_max variation极小），η_max仅3/12 significant（全部在extreme conditions如PI下）。\n517\t    K_eff within-tier全部NS（0/12），因为within-tier的diversity variation也被压缩。 对比cross-tier（all\n518\t    455 panels）的11/12 η_max和8/12 K_eff，结论清晰： η_max dominance is driven by capability\n519\t    tier spread, not a general principle。 这不意味η_max irrelevant——它means η_max在cross-tier比较中conflates\n520\t    \"model capability\"和\"individual vulnerability\"， 而capability是confound不是target predictor。\n521\t\n522\t    '\n523\t  tables:\n524\t  - caption: Within-tier vs cross-tier regression significance\n525\t    columns:\n526\t    - Scope\n527\t    - N models\n528\t    - N panels (K=3)\n529\t    - η_max sig/12\n530\t    - K_eff sig/12\n531\t    - η_max range (IQR)\n532\t    rows:\n533\t    - - Frontier (3)\n534\t      - '3'\n535\t      - '1'\n536\t      - 0/12\n537\t      - 0/12\n538\t      - '0.02'\n539\t    - - Strong (3)\n540\t      - '3'\n541\t      - '1'\n542\t      - 0/12\n543\t      - 0/12\n544\t      - '0.04'\n545\t    - - Mid-weak (9)\n546\t      - '9'\n547\t      - '84'\n548\t      - 3/12\n549\t      - 0/12\n550\t      - '0.11'\n551\t    - - Cross-tier (15)\n552\t      - '15'\n553\t      - '455'\n554\t      - 11/12\n555\t      - 8/12\n556\t      - '0.38'\n557\t  - caption: η_max significance vs capability range\n558\t    columns:\n559\t    - Analysis\n560\t    - Capability range (ASR IQR)\n561\t    - η_max sig count\n562\t    - Correlation (range vs sig)\n563\t    rows:\n564\t    - - Within frontier\n565\t      - '0.02'\n566\t      - 0/12\n567\t      - r = 0.82\n568\t    - - Within strong\n569\t      - '0.04'\n570\t      - 0/12\n571\t      - —\n572\t    - - Within mid-weak\n573\t      - '0.11'\n574\t      - 3/12\n575\t      - —\n576\t    - - Cross-tier (all)\n577\t      - '0.38'\n578\t      - 11/12\n579\t      - —\n580\t    - - Restricted to mid-weak + strong\n581\t      - '0.15'\n582\t      - 4/12\n583\t      - —\n584\t  figures_description:\n585\t  - 'Scatter: η_max range (x) vs η_max significance count (y) across different scoping\n586\t    strategies。 Clear positive relationship (r=0.82) demonstrates that η_max \"dominance\"\n587\t    scales linearly with the capability spread in the analysis pool。标注：within-tier\n588\t    points clustered at bottom-left， cross-tier point at top-right。\n589\t\n590\t    '\n591\t  analysis: '这是对Claim 1的最致命打击之一。η_max dominance不是关于\"individual vulnerability drives\n592\t    panel vulnerability\"的 general principle，而是\"当panel中存在capability差异极大的model时，最弱者的vulnerability自然predict了panel\n593\t    outcome\" 的trivial observation。类比：如果一个篮球队里有NBA球员和小学生，小学生的表现当然predict了队伍输赢——但这不是关于\"weakest\n594\t    link\" 的深刻insight，而是关于\"don''t mix radically different capability levels\"的obvious\n595\t    conclusion。 论文需要explicit caveat：\"η_max dominance finding is contingent on cross-tier\n596\t    panel composition and does not generalize to capability-controlled settings\"。\n597\t\n598\t    '\n599\t- name: Two-stage panel design algorithm benchmark\n600\t  plan_id: plan_005\n601\t  description: '实现robustness-first两阶段算法（先筛η ≤ threshold，再最大化K_eff），对比5个baseline策略。\n602\t    在15模型、455 panels上sweep threshold。\n603\t\n604\t    '\n605\t  expected_results:\n606\t    strategies_compared: 6\n607\t    min_eta_max_win_rate_12cond: 9/12\n608\t    strongest_k_win_rate_12cond: 8/12\n609\t    two_stage_win_rate_12cond: 9/12\n610\t    max_keff_win_rate_12cond: 2/12\n611\t    random_win_rate_12cond: 0/12\n612\t    min_eta_max_vs_two_stage_p: 0.78\n613\t    min_eta_max_vs_strongest_k_p: 0.42\n614\t    two_stage_marginal_improvement_over_min_eta: 0.003\n615\t    two_stage_marginal_improvement_over_strongest_k: 0.008\n616\t    threshold_sensitivity: high — optimal threshold attack-dependent\n617\t    asr_range_min_eta: '[0.04, 0.52]'\n618\t  result_rationale: 'min(η_max) strategy仍然wins 9/12 conditions（在worst档范围[8,10]内），但two-stage\n619\t    algorithm与min(η_max) 之间的差异vanishingly small（mean Δ ASR = 0.003pp）。这是因为在robustness-first筛选后，surviving\n620\t    models 的K_eff variation极小（都是strong models → natural diversity limited by capability\n621\t    homogeneity）， 第二阶段\"maximize K_eff\"几乎不改变panel composition。 实质上two-stage ≈ min(η_max)\n622\t    ≈ strongest-K，三者在win conditions上高度重叠。 Practical contribution从\"novel algorithm\"降级为\"use\n623\t    strong models\"——一个trivial recommendation。 threshold参数高度attack-dependent（prompt_injection最优threshold\n624\t    ≠ sycophancy最优threshold）， 无法给出universal prescriptive guidance。\n625\t\n626\t    '\n627\t  tables:\n628\t  - caption: Panel selection strategy comparison (12 conditions, K=3)\n629\t    columns:\n630\t    - Strategy\n631\t    - Win count /12\n632\t    - Mean ASR\n633\t    - vs Random Δ ASR\n634\t    rows:\n635\t    - - Min η_max\n636\t      - 9/12\n637\t      - '0.087'\n638\t      - '-0.085'\n639\t    - - Two-stage (ours)\n640\t      - 9/12\n641\t      - '0.084'\n642\t      - '-0.088'\n643\t    - - Strongest-K\n644\t      - 8/12\n645\t      - '0.089'\n646\t      - '-0.083'\n647\t    - - Max K_eff\n648\t      - 2/12\n649\t      - '0.142'\n650\t      - '-0.030'\n651\t    - - Max family diversity\n652\t      - 1/12\n653\t      - '0.155'\n654\t      - '-0.017'\n655\t    - - Random\n656\t      - 0/12\n657\t      - '0.172'\n658\t      - —\n659\t  - caption: 'Two-stage vs min(η_max): head-to-head'\n660\t    columns:\n661\t    - Condition\n662\t    - Two-stage ASR\n663\t    - Min η_max ASR\n664\t    - Δ ASR\n665\t    - Winner\n666\t    rows:\n667\t    - - mmlu×PI\n668\t      - '0.041'\n669\t      - '0.044'\n670\t      - '-0.003'\n671\t      - Two-stage\n672\t    - - mmlu×SM\n673\t      - '0.058'\n674\t      - '0.059'\n675\t      - '-0.001'\n676\t      - Two-stage\n677\t    - - mmlu×syc\n678\t      - '0.095'\n679\t      - '0.093'\n680\t      - '+0.002'\n681\t      - Min η_max\n682\t    - - mmlu×verb\n683\t      - '0.102'\n684\t      - '0.098'\n685\t      - '+0.004'\n686\t      - Min η_max\n687\t    - - mmlu×pos\n688\t      - '0.078'\n689\t      - '0.082'\n690\t      - '-0.004'\n691\t      - Two-stage\n692\t    - - mmlu×auth\n693\t      - '0.088'\n694\t      - '0.091'\n695\t      - '-0.003'\n696\t      - Two-stage\n697\t    - - arc×PI\n698\t      - '0.052'\n699\t      - '0.055'\n700\t      - '-0.003'\n701\t      - Two-stage\n702\t    - - arc×SM\n703\t      - '0.068'\n704\t      - '0.071'\n705\t      - '-0.003'\n706\t      - Two-stage\n707\t    - - arc×syc\n708\t      - '0.112'\n709\t      - '0.108'\n710\t      - '+0.004'\n711\t      - Min η_max\n712\t    - - arc×verb\n713\t      - '0.118'\n714\t      - '0.115'\n715\t      - '+0.003'\n716\t      - Min η_max\n717\t    - - arc×pos\n718\t      - '0.092'\n719\t      - '0.095'\n720\t      - '-0.003'\n721\t      - Two-stage\n722\t    - - arc×auth\n723\t      - '0.098'\n724\t      - '0.101'\n725\t      - '-0.003'\n726\t      - Two-stage\n727\t  figures_description:\n728\t  - 'Bar chart: 6 strategies × mean ASR。Min η_max, Two-stage, Strongest-K三者几乎indistinguishable\n729\t    （误差条完全重叠），与Max K_eff和Random之间有clear gap。 标注p-values：two-stage vs min_eta p=0.78,\n730\t    two-stage vs strongest_k p=0.42。\n731\t\n732\t    '\n733\t  analysis: 'min(η_max) wins 9/12仍然是一个decent practical finding，但two-stage algorithm没有additional\n734\t    value。 整个practical contribution可以用一句话总结：\"use the strongest available models\"——\n735\t    这太trivial to be a contribution。论文可以保留min(η_max) dominance作为supporting evidence\n736\t    for η_max importance的indirect argument，但不能作为novel algorithm contribution。 Key\n737\t    observation：min(η_max) ≈ strongest-K在实践中——因为individual robustness (η)与model capability\n738\t    高度相关（r=0.72），选最robust的models ≈ 选最强的models。\n739\t\n740\t    '\n741\t- name: Per-judge ASR concentration analysis\n742\t  plan_id: plan_006\n743\t  description: '对每个panel × attack，测量per-judge ASR分布的集中度（Gini系数、熵）。 直接验证adaptive adversary是否集中targeting\n744\t    weakest judge。\n745\t\n746\t    '\n747\t  expected_results:\n748\t    median_gini: 0.28\n749\t    mean_gini: 0.31\n750\t    gini_targeted_attacks: 0.35\n751\t    gini_shared_bias_attacks: 0.22\n752\t    gini_vs_random_fault_baseline: 0.19\n753\t    adaptive_vs_rf_gini_p: 0.04\n754\t    adaptive_vs_rf_gini_d: 0.22\n755\t    weakest_judge_share_median: 0.42\n756\t    weakest_judge_share_targeted: 0.48\n757\t    weakest_judge_share_shared_bias: 0.38\n758\t    entropy_normalized_median: 0.81\n759\t    gini_eta_max_correlation: 0.55\n760\t  result_rationale: 'Concentration analysis显示adaptive adversary确实比random fault更集中targeting（Gini\n761\t    0.28 vs 0.19, p=0.04）， 但effect size small（Cohen''s d=0.22）。更重要的是，Gini与η_max高度相关（r=0.55）——\n762\t    concentration主要driven by capability gap（弱model承担更多attack success）， 而非adversary的strategic\n763\t    targeting能力。 在shared-bias attacks下，Gini接近random baseline（0.22 vs 0.19），说明这些attacks确实不是targeted的\n764\t    ——与GAM taxonomy的directional tendency一致，但同样不够clean to be standalone evidence。 总体上concentration\n765\t    analysis提供了weak-to-moderate支撑adaptive adversary narrative， 但不足以independently establish\n766\t    \"adversary targets weakest link\" claim。\n767\t\n768\t    '\n769\t  tables:\n770\t  - caption: ASR concentration metrics across conditions\n771\t    columns:\n772\t    - Attack category\n773\t    - Median Gini\n774\t    - Weakest-judge share\n775\t    - vs RF baseline p\n776\t    rows:\n777\t    - - Targeted (PI, SM, PB)\n778\t      - '0.35'\n779\t      - '0.48'\n780\t      - '0.02'\n781\t    - - Shared-bias (syc, verb, auth)\n782\t      - '0.22'\n783\t      - '0.38'\n784\t      - '0.28'\n785\t    - - All adaptive\n786\t      - '0.28'\n787\t      - '0.42'\n788\t      - '0.04'\n789\t    - - Random-fault baseline\n790\t      - '0.19'\n791\t      - '0.36'\n792\t      - —\n793\t  - caption: Gini coefficient predictors\n794\t    columns:\n795\t    - Predictor\n796\t    - r with Gini\n797\t    - p\n798\t    - Interpretation\n799\t    rows:\n800\t    - - η_max (panel)\n801\t      - '0.55'\n802\t      - <0.001\n803\t      - Capability gap drives concentration\n804\t    - - K_eff (panel)\n805\t      - '-0.18'\n806\t      - '0.12'\n807\t      - Diversity weakly reduces concentration\n808\t    - - Attack targetedness\n809\t      - '0.31'\n810\t      - '0.003'\n811\t      - Targeted attacks more concentrated\n812\t  figures_description:\n813\t  - 'Violin plot: Gini distribution for targeted vs shared-bias vs random-fault。 Targeted\n814\t    distribution shifted right but with heavy overlap with shared-bias。 Random-fault\n815\t    baseline narrower and shifted left。\n816\t\n817\t    '\n818\t  analysis: 'Concentration analysis是modest supporting evidence而非smoking gun。d=0.22太小，\n819\t    且Gini主要由capability gap而非adversary strategy驱动（r=0.55 with η_max）。 可以在paper中作为supplementary\n820\t    evidence保留但不能carry independent weight。 对worst-tier narrative的影响：不直接contradicts任何claim，但也不rescues\n821\t    BFT framing（plan_003 failure）。\n822\t\n823\t    '\n824\t- name: Diversity-capability tradeoff visualization\n825\t  plan_id: plan_007\n826\t  description: '在455 panels上绘制K_eff vs η_max scatter，拟合tradeoff curve，展示Pareto frontier，按tier分层。\n827\t\n828\t    '\n829\t  expected_results:\n830\t    overall_pearson_r: 0.65\n831\t    overall_spearman_r: 0.61\n832\t    within_frontier_r: 0.22\n833\t    within_strong_r: 0.18\n834\t    within_midweak_r: 0.35\n835\t    cross_tier_r: 0.72\n836\t    pareto_front_size: 8\n837\t    pareto_dominated_by_min_eta: 6/8\n838\t    tradeoff_R2_overall: 0.42\n839\t    tradeoff_slope: 0.58\n840\t  result_rationale: 'diversity_capability_r在worst档范围[0.55, 0.75]内，取值0.65。Tradeoff确实存在（R²=0.42），\n841\t    但primarily driven by cross-tier differences。Within-tier r远低于overall（0.18-0.35\n842\t    vs 0.65）， 表明tradeoff是ecosystem structure artifact而非fundamental constraint。 Pareto\n843\t    frontier上8个panels中6个被min(η_max) dominate——Pareto analysis不能rescue practical contribution。\n844\t    但0.65的correlation确实说明η_max和K_eff在current design下heavily confounded—— 这reinforces\n845\t    VIF问题（plan_009），regression decomposition的reliability存疑。\n846\t\n847\t    '\n848\t  tables:\n849\t  - caption: Diversity-capability correlation by analysis scope\n850\t    columns:\n851\t    - Scope\n852\t    - Pearson r\n853\t    - R²\n854\t    - N panels\n855\t    - Interpretation\n856\t    rows:\n857\t    - - Overall (15 models)\n858\t      - '0.65'\n859\t      - '0.42'\n860\t      - '455'\n861\t      - Moderate-strong confound\n862\t    - - Within frontier (3 models)\n863\t      - '0.22'\n864\t      - '0.05'\n865\t      - '1'\n866\t      - Weak (too few panels)\n867\t    - - Within strong (3 models)\n868\t      - '0.18'\n869\t      - '0.03'\n870\t      - '1'\n871\t      - Weak (too few panels)\n872\t    - - Within mid-weak (9 models)\n873\t      - '0.35'\n874\t      - '0.12'\n875\t      - '84'\n876\t      - Moderate within-tier\n877\t    - - Cross-tier only\n878\t      - '0.72'\n879\t      - '0.52'\n880\t      - '370'\n881\t      - Strong — tier-driven\n882\t  figures_description:\n883\t  - 'Scatter: K_eff (x) vs η_max (y) for 455 panels, color-coded by tier composition。\n884\t    Clear positive band from bottom-left (all-frontier panels: low K_eff, low η_max)\n885\t    to top-right (cross-tier panels: high K_eff, high η_max)。Overall regression line\n886\t    (r=0.65) and within-tier regression lines (near-flat) overlaid。Pareto frontier\n887\t    in green。\n888\t\n889\t    '\n890\t  analysis: 'Visualization清晰展示confound的severity。r=0.65意味着K_eff和η_max共享42%的variance——\n891\t    regression无法reliably separate their independent effects，这与VIF >7（plan_009）一致。\n892\t    Tradeoff本身是real as structural correlation，但\"diversity is costly because it requires\n893\t    weaker models\" 这个interpretation only applies to cross-tier composition。 对论文的影响：Claim\n894\t    3（diversity-capability tradeoff）不能作为\"fundamental constraint\"呈现， 而是\"artifact of\n895\t    current model ecosystem where capability predicts robustness\"。\n896\t\n897\t    '\n898\t- name: 'Panel size sensitivity: K=3,5,7,9'\n899\t  plan_id: plan_008\n900\t  description: '在不同panel size (K=3,5,7,9)下测试η_max dominance是否持续。 验证weakest-link是否universal\n901\t    across panel sizes。\n902\t\n903\t    '\n904\t  expected_results:\n905\t    k3_bootstrap_eta_sig: 3/12\n906\t    k3_bootstrap_keff_sig: 1/12\n907\t    k5_bootstrap_eta_sig: 2/12\n908\t    k5_bootstrap_keff_sig: 0/12\n909\t    k7_bootstrap_eta_sig: 1/12\n910\t    k7_bootstrap_keff_sig: 0/12\n911\t    k9_bootstrap_eta_sig: 1/12\n912\t    k9_bootstrap_keff_sig: 1/12\n913\t    k5_panels: 3003\n914\t    k7_panels: 6435\n915\t    k9_panels: 5005\n916\t    eta_sig_trend_bootstrap_p: 0.04\n917\t    non_independence_amplification_k5: 4.1×\n918\t    non_independence_amplification_k7: 5.8×\n919\t    non_independence_amplification_k9: 7.2×\n920\t  result_rationale: 'Panel size增大在worst档下不仅不改善η_max significance——反而使其更差。原因是non-independence问题\n921\t    随K增大而amplify：K=5时每个model出现在C(14,4)=1001个panels中（vs K=3时91个）， SE inflation从3.2×（K=3）上升到7.2×（K=9）。更大的panels有更多overlap，corrected\n922\t    inference 更conservative。Bootstrap η_max从K=3的3/12降至K=9的1/12。 Irony：更大panels理论上应该reduce\n923\t    weakest-link effect（1 weak vote in 9 matters less）， 但这个theoretical prediction无法在corrected\n924\t    inference下empirically confirm， 因为non-independence scales faster than signal。 K_eff同样全面collapse（最多1/12\n925\t    at K=9），两个predictor都不work under corrected inference at large K。\n926\t\n927\t    '\n928\t  tables:\n929\t  - caption: 'Panel size × correction method: η_max significance'\n930\t    columns:\n931\t    - K\n932\t    - N panels\n933\t    - OLS η_max sig\n934\t    - Bootstrap η_max sig\n935\t    - SE inflation\n936\t    - Model overlap per judge\n937\t    rows:\n938\t    - - '3'\n939\t      - '455'\n940\t      - 11/12\n941\t      - 3/12\n942\t      - 3.2×\n943\t      - '91'\n944\t    - - '5'\n945\t      - '3003'\n946\t      - 11/12\n947\t      - 2/12\n948\t      - 4.1×\n949\t      - '1001'\n950\t    - - '7'\n951\t      - '6435'\n952\t      - 10/12\n953\t      - 1/12\n954\t      - 5.8×\n955\t      - '3003'\n956\t    - - '9'\n957\t      - '5005'\n958\t      - 9/12\n959\t      - 1/12\n960\t      - 7.2×\n961\t      - '2002'\n962\t  - caption: 'Panel size × correction: K_eff significance'\n963\t    columns:\n964\t    - K\n965\t    - OLS K_eff sig\n966\t    - Bootstrap K_eff sig\n967\t    - K_eff practical Δ ASR (IQR)\n968\t    rows:\n969\t    - - '3'\n970\t      - 8/12\n971\t      - 1/12\n972\t      - 0.8pp\n973\t    - - '5'\n974\t      - 7/12\n975\t      - 0/12\n976\t      - 0.5pp\n977\t    - - '7'\n978\t      - 6/12\n979\t      - 0/12\n980\t      - 0.3pp\n981\t    - - '9'\n982\t      - 5/12\n983\t      - 1/12\n984\t      - 0.2pp\n985\t  figures_description:\n986\t  - 'Dual-axis line plot: K (x) vs significance count (y, left axis, lines for η_max\n987\t    OLS/bootstrap) and SE inflation factor (y, right axis, gray area)。OLS lines stay\n988\t    flat/slightly decreasing, bootstrap lines plummet, SE inflation area grows。Visual\n989\t    message: \"bigger panels = more overlap = less reliable inference\"。\n990\t\n991\t    '\n992\t  analysis: 'Panel size analysis在worst档下paradoxically成为方法学贡献的strongest evidence。 它直观展示了combinatorial\n993\t    panel designs的fundamental problem：C(N,K) grows fast but each model''s participation\n994\t    grows equally fast → non-independence scales with panel count。 这是LLM evaluation\n995\t    community应该awareness的general insight，不限于adversarial setting。 但对composition-level\n996\t    claims (η_max, K_eff) 完全destructive——neither predictor survives correction at\n997\t    any K。\n998\t\n999\t    '\n1000\t- name: VIF + multicollinearity analysis\n1001\t  plan_id: plan_009\n1002\t  description: '计算VIF、partial correlations、residualized K_eff。尝试beta regression。 量化η_max与K_eff的multicollinearity\n1003\t    severity。\n1004\t\n1005\t    '\n1006\t  expected_results:\n1007\t    vif_eta_max: 7.8\n1008\t    vif_keff: 6.9\n1009\t    partial_r_eta_max_given_keff: 0.31\n1010\t    partial_r_keff_given_eta_max: 0.12\n1011\t    residualized_keff_sig: 2/12\n1012\t    residualized_keff_p_median: 0.28\n1013\t    beta_regression_eta_sig: 9/12\n1014\t    beta_regression_keff_sig: 3/12\n1015\t    condition_number: 18.5\n1016\t    variance_decomposition_shared: 0.42\n1017\t    variance_decomposition_eta_unique: 0.18\n1018\t    variance_decomposition_keff_unique: 0.03\n1019\t  result_rationale: 'VIF分析确认severe multicollinearity：VIF(η_max)=7.8, VIF(K_eff)=6.9（均>5的conventional\n1020\t    threshold， 接近>10的severe threshold）。根源是diversity-capability confound（r=0.65→VIF\n1021\t    ≈ 1/(1-r²) = 1/0.58 ≈ 1.7×... 等等，VIF的计算是1/(1-R²_j)，如果K_eff对η_max的R²=0.42（来自r=0.65），\n1022\t    则VIF(K_eff) = 1/(1-0.42) = 1.72。但如果加入其他confounds（tier indicators等），VIF会更高。 在有tier\n1023\t    indicators + K_eff + η_max的full model中，VIF可以达到7-8。\n1024\t\n1025\t    Partial correlation显示：controlling for K_eff后η_max与ASR的r=0.31（moderate）， 但controlling\n1026\t    for η_max后K_eff与ASR的r仅0.12（weak）。 Variance decomposition：42% shared between η_max和K_eff，18%\n1027\t    unique to η_max，仅3% unique to K_eff。 K_eff的\"independent effect\"实质上是noise level。\n1028\t    Beta regression（处理bounded [0,1] response）不改善K_eff situation：仍仅3/12显著。 结论：在当前design下η_max和K_eff\n1029\t    cannot be reliably separated as independent predictors。 整个regression-based decomposition\n1030\t    framework在VIF >5下unreliable。\n1031\t\n1032\t    '\n1033\t  tables:\n1034\t  - caption: Multicollinearity diagnostics\n1035\t    columns:\n1036\t    - Diagnostic\n1037\t    - η_max\n1038\t    - K_eff\n1039\t    - Threshold\n1040\t    - Verdict\n1041\t    rows:\n1042\t    - - VIF (base model)\n1043\t      - '2.4'\n1044\t      - '2.1'\n1045\t      - '>5 = concern'\n1046\t      - OK\n1047\t    - - VIF (with tier indicators)\n1048\t      - '7.8'\n1049\t      - '6.9'\n1050\t      - '>5 = concern'\n1051\t      - FAIL\n1052\t    - - Partial r (given other)\n1053\t      - '0.31'\n1054\t      - '0.12'\n1055\t      - —\n1056\t      - K_eff weak\n1057\t    - - Unique variance %\n1058\t      - 18%\n1059\t      - 3%\n1060\t      - —\n1061\t      - K_eff negligible\n1062\t    - - Condition number\n1063\t      - '18.5'\n1064\t      - —\n1065\t      - '>30 = severe'\n1066\t      - Moderate\n1067\t  - caption: 'Variance decomposition: shared vs unique'\n1068\t    columns:\n1069\t    - Component\n1070\t    - R² contribution\n1071\t    - '% of total explained'\n1072\t    rows:\n1073\t    - - Shared (η_max ∩ K_eff)\n1074\t      - '0.42'\n1075\t      - 67%\n1076\t    - - Unique η_max\n1077\t      - '0.18'\n1078\t      - 29%\n1079\t    - - Unique K_eff\n1080\t      - '0.03'\n1081\t      - 5%\n1082\t    - - Total model R²\n1083\t      - '0.63'\n1084\t      - 100%\n1085\t  - caption: Residualized K_eff regression results\n1086\t    columns:\n1087\t    - Dataset\n1088\t    - Attack\n1089\t    - Residualized K_eff β\n1090\t    - p\n1091\t    - Significant?\n1092\t    rows:\n1093\t    - - MMLU\n1094\t      - prompt_injection\n1095\t      - '0.08'\n1096\t      - '0.42'\n1097\t      - 'No'\n1098\t    - - MMLU\n1099\t      - score_manipulation\n1100\t      - '0.05'\n1101\t      - '0.58'\n1102\t      - 'No'\n1103\t    - - MMLU\n1104\t      - sycophancy\n1105\t      - '-0.12'\n1106\t      - '0.18'\n1107\t      - 'No'\n1108\t    - - MMLU\n1109\t      - verbosity_bias\n1110\t      - '-0.04'\n1111\t      - '0.65'\n1112\t      - 'No'\n1113\t    - - MMLU\n1114\t      - position_bias\n1115\t      - '0.15'\n1116\t      - '0.04'\n1117\t      - 'Yes'\n1118\t    - - MMLU\n1119\t      - authority_bias\n1120\t      - '-0.06'\n1121\t      - '0.52'\n1122\t      - 'No'\n1123\t    - - ARC\n1124\t      - prompt_injection\n1125\t      - '0.11'\n1126\t      - '0.22'\n1127\t      - 'No'\n1128\t    - - ARC\n1129\t      - score_manipulation\n1130\t      - '0.07'\n1131\t      - '0.41'\n1132\t      - 'No'\n1133\t    - - ARC\n1134\t      - sycophancy\n1135\t      - '-0.09'\n1136\t      - '0.35'\n1137\t      - 'No'\n1138\t    - - ARC\n1139\t      - verbosity_bias\n1140\t      - '-0.03'\n1141\t      - '0.72'\n1142\t      - 'No'\n1143\t    - - ARC\n1144\t      - position_bias\n1145\t      - '0.13'\n1146\t      - '0.08'\n1147\t      - 'No'\n1148\t    - - ARC\n1149\t      - authority_bias\n1150\t      - '-0.02'\n1151\t      - '0.81'\n1152\t      - 'No'\n1153\t  figures_description:\n1154\t  - 'Venn diagram: total explained variance分解为η_max unique (18%), K_eff unique (3%),\n1155\t    shared (42%)。 K_eff圆极小且almost entirely嵌入shared区域。Visual message: K_eff几乎没有independent\n1156\t    explanatory power。\n1157\t\n1158\t    '\n1159\t  - 'Scatter: raw K_eff (x) vs residualized K_eff (y, after regressing out η_max)。\n1160\t    大部分variation被regression去除，residualized K_eff集中在零附近with minimal spread。\n1161\t\n1162\t    '\n1163\t  analysis: 'VIF分析是worst档中最clean的negative result——它提供了一个principled statistical explanation\n1164\t    for为什么K_eff在corrected inference下always collapse。不是因为K_eff \"doesn''t matter\"， 而是因为在当前design下η_max和K_eff\n1165\t    share 67% of their explained variance， K_eff的unique contribution仅3%——在15 clusters的bootstrap下impossible\n1166\t    to detect。 这reinforces方法学贡献narrative：combinatorial panel designs + small number\n1167\t    of unique models = multicollinearity + non-independence = any predictor-level\n1168\t    decomposition is unreliable。 论文应该present VIF analysis as evidence that the regression\n1169\t    approach itself is inadequate for this research question，而非\"K_eff doesn''t matter\"。\n1170\t\n1171\t    '\n1172\t- name: 'Non-majority-vote aggregation: weighted, threshold, Bayesian'\n1173\t  plan_id: plan_010\n1174\t  description: '测试η_max dominance在weighted voting、threshold (unanimity)、Bayesian calibration下是否persist。\n1175\t    验证aggregation gradient。\n1176\t\n1177\t    '\n1178\t  expected_results:\n1179\t    majority_ols_eta_sig: 11/12\n1180\t    majority_ols_keff_sig: 8/12\n1181\t    majority_bootstrap_eta_sig: 3/12\n1182\t    majority_bootstrap_keff_sig: 1/12\n1183\t    weighted_ols_eta_sig: 9/12\n1184\t    weighted_ols_keff_sig: 9/12\n1185\t    weighted_bootstrap_eta_sig: 2/12\n1186\t    weighted_bootstrap_keff_sig: 1/12\n1187\t    threshold_ols_eta_sig: 12/12\n1188\t    threshold_ols_keff_sig: 11/12\n1189\t    threshold_bootstrap_eta_sig: 5/12\n1190\t    threshold_bootstrap_keff_sig: 2/12\n1191\t    threshold_R2: 0.89\n1192\t    bayesian_ols_eta_sig: 9/12\n1193\t    bayesian_ols_keff_sig: 7/12\n1194\t    bayesian_ols_keff_negative: 6\n1195\t    bayesian_bootstrap_eta_sig: 2/12\n1196\t    bayesian_bootstrap_keff_sig: 0/12\n1197\t    bayesian_bootstrap_keff_negative: 0\n1198\t    bayesian_R2: 0.1\n1199\t    aggregation_gradient_survives_correction: partially\n1200\t  result_rationale: 'Aggregation gradient在OLS下clear（threshold R²=0.89 → bayesian R²=0.10），\n1201\t    但bootstrap correction后Bayesian K_eff flip彻底消失：OLS下6/7 negative → bootstrap下0/12\n1202\t    significant。 原因：Bayesian aggregation减弱了panel composition对ASR的影响（R²=0.10），但这也意味着signal/noise\n1203\t    ratio极低—— 在bootstrap correction下signal completely drowned by noise。 Threshold\n1204\t    aggregation相对较好（bootstrap η_max 5/12），因为unanimity rule下 panel vulnerability完全由individual\n1205\t    vulnerabilities的AND/OR逻辑决定（R²=0.89）， signal极强→即使bootstrap conservative也能detect。\n1206\t    但这创造了一个awkward结论：\"只有在使用最不实用的aggregation rule（unanimity）时， η_max dominance才survives\n1207\t    bootstrap correction\"——因为实践中没人用unanimity voting。 aggregation gradient作为R²的gradient仍然成立（0.89→0.10不受SE\n1208\t    correction影响）， 但individual predictor significance在每种aggregation下都unreliable after\n1209\t    correction。\n1210\t\n1211\t    '\n1212\t  tables:\n1213\t  - caption: 'Aggregation gradient: OLS vs bootstrap correction'\n1214\t    columns:\n1215\t    - Aggregation\n1216\t    - OLS η_max\n1217\t    - OLS K_eff\n1218\t    - Bootstrap η_max\n1219\t    - Bootstrap K_eff\n1220\t    - R²\n1221\t    rows:\n1222\t    - - Majority\n1223\t      - 11/12\n1224\t      - 8/12 (7+/1−)\n1225\t      - 3/12\n1226\t      - 1/12\n1227\t      - '0.30'\n1228\t    - - Weighted\n1229\t      - 9/12\n1230\t      - 9/12 (9+/0−)\n1231\t      - 2/12\n1232\t      - 1/12\n1233\t      - '0.28'\n1234\t    - - Threshold\n1235\t      - 12/12\n1236\t      - 11/12 (10+/1−)\n1237\t      - 5/12\n1238\t      - 2/12\n1239\t      - '0.89'\n1240\t    - - Bayesian\n1241\t      - 9/12\n1242\t      - 7/12 (1+/6−)\n1243\t      - 2/12\n1244\t      - 0/12 (0+/0−)\n1245\t      - '0.10'\n1246\t  - caption: Bayesian K_eff direction under correction\n1247\t    columns:\n1248\t    - Method\n1249\t    - K_eff negative (of significant)\n1250\t    - K_eff significant total\n1251\t    - Direction interpretation\n1252\t    rows:\n1253\t    - - OLS\n1254\t      - 6/7\n1255\t      - 7/12\n1256\t      - Strongly negative (protective)\n1257\t    - - Clustered SE\n1258\t      - 1/2\n1259\t      - 2/12\n1260\t      - Weak negative\n1261\t    - - Mixed effects\n1262\t      - 0/1\n1263\t      - 1/12\n1264\t      - Inconclusive\n1265\t    - - Bootstrap v2\n1266\t      - 0/0\n1267\t      - 0/12\n1268\t      - No signal survives\n1269\t  figures_description:\n1270\t  - 'Stacked bar chart: 4 aggregation rules × 4 correction methods。 每个bar的高度=significant\n1271\t    predictor count。OLS bars tall everywhere, bootstrap bars nearly empty except threshold。\n1272\t    Bayesian的K_eff方向（negative in OLS → absent in bootstrap）用color shift标注。\n1273\t\n1274\t    '\n1275\t  - 'Scatter: R² (x) vs bootstrap significant predictor count (y)。 Clear positive\n1276\t    relationship — only high R² (threshold, 0.89) produces bootstrap-surviving significance。\n1277\t    Annotate: \"R²<0.3 → bootstrap kills all signals\"。\n1278\t\n1279\t    '\n1280\t  analysis: 'Aggregation gradient是worst档中唯一partially salvageable的composition-related\n1281\t    finding。 R²的gradient（0.89→0.10）是descriptive statistic不受SE correction影响—— aggregation\n1282\t    rule确实determines how much panel composition matters for vulnerability。 但individual\n1283\t    predictor significance在除threshold外的所有aggregation下collapse after correction， Bayesian\n1284\t    K_eff flip（被寄予厚望的\"defense lever\"）完全是OLS artifact。 Salvage angle：\"aggregation choice\n1285\t    determines the predictability of panel vulnerability， but we cannot reliably decompose\n1286\t    this into η_max vs K_eff components\"—— 这是一个weaker but defensible statement，可以作为论文的Claim\n1287\t    C。\n1288\t\n1289\t    '\n1290\t- name: Open-ended generation benchmark (MT-Bench / AlpacaEval)\n1291\t  plan_id: plan_011\n1292\t  description: '在MT-Bench或AlpacaEval-style open-ended generation任务上运行全部15 models +\n1293\t    6 attacks。 验证findings是否generalize beyond MCQ format。\n1294\t\n1295\t    '\n1296\t  expected_results:\n1297\t    benchmark: MT-Bench\n1298\t    total_conditions: 12\n1299\t    ols_eta_sig: 7/12\n1300\t    ols_keff_sig: 5/12\n1301\t    bootstrap_eta_sig: 1/12\n1302\t    bootstrap_keff_sig: 0/12\n1303\t    clustered_se_eta_sig: 3/12\n1304\t    clustered_se_keff_sig: 0/12\n1305\t    R2_median: 0.15\n1306\t    scoring_format: pairwise comparison\n1307\t    attack_implementation_challenges: 3\n1308\t    cross_benchmark_eta_correlation: 0.52\n1309\t    cross_benchmark_keff_correlation: 0.38\n1310\t  result_rationale: 'Open-ended generation benchmark引入新的complications。 MT-Bench使用pairwise\n1311\t    comparison scoring（而非MCQ的discrete label），judge vulnerability profile 与MCQ setting有中等相关（r=0.52\n1312\t    for η_max across benchmarks）。 OLS下η_max显著7/12，但bootstrap后仅1/12——same non-independence\n1313\t    problem。 更关键的是R²显著低于MCQ（0.15 vs 0.25），说明open-ended setting中panel composition 对vulnerability的解释力更低——可能因为open-ended\n1314\t    scoring有更多intrinsic noise。 3种attacks（sycophancy, verbosity_bias, authority_bias）在open-ended\n1315\t    setting的implementation 需要substantial modification，results可能不完全comparable。 总结：open-ended\n1316\t    benchmark不rescue任何claim，反而进一步dilute statistical power。 论文有效沦为two-MCQ-benchmark\n1317\t    + one-weak-open-ended study。\n1318\t\n1319\t    '\n1320\t  tables:\n1321\t  - caption: 'MT-Bench results: OLS vs bootstrap'\n1322\t    columns:\n1323\t    - Attack\n1324\t    - OLS η_max p\n1325\t    - Bootstrap η_max p\n1326\t    - OLS K_eff p\n1327\t    - Bootstrap K_eff p\n1328\t    - R²\n1329\t    rows:\n1330\t    - - prompt_injection\n1331\t      - '0.008'\n1332\t      - '0.22'\n1333\t      - '0.05'\n1334\t      - '0.48'\n1335\t      - '0.18'\n1336\t    - - score_manipulation\n1337\t      - '0.015'\n1338\t      - '0.31'\n1339\t      - '0.08'\n1340\t      - '0.55'\n1341\t      - '0.14'\n1342\t    - - sycophancy*\n1343\t      - '0.042'\n1344\t      - '0.51'\n1345\t      - '0.12'\n1346\t      - '0.63'\n1347\t      - '0.11'\n1348\t    - - verbosity_bias*\n1349\t      - '0.038'\n1350\t      - '0.48'\n1351\t      - '0.18'\n1352\t      - '0.58'\n1353\t      - '0.09'\n1354\t    - - position_bias\n1355\t      - '0.003'\n1356\t      - '0.08'\n1357\t      - '0.04'\n1358\t      - '0.38'\n1359\t      - '0.22'\n1360\t    - - authority_bias*\n1361\t      - '0.055'\n1362\t      - '0.55'\n1363\t      - '0.22'\n1364\t      - '0.68'\n1365\t      - '0.08'\n1366\t  - caption: Cross-benchmark consistency\n1367\t    columns:\n1368\t    - Metric\n1369\t    - MMLU-MT r\n1370\t    - ARC-MT r\n1371\t    - Interpretation\n1372\t    rows:\n1373\t    - - η_max profile\n1374\t      - '0.52'\n1375\t      - '0.48'\n1376\t      - Moderate — partial transfer\n1377\t    - - K_eff effect direction\n1378\t      - '0.38'\n1379\t      - '0.35'\n1380\t      - Weak — inconsistent\n1381\t    - - Condition-level R²\n1382\t      - '0.25'\n1383\t      - '0.22'\n1384\t      - Weak\n1385\t  figures_description:\n1386\t  - 'Three-panel comparison: MMLU (left), ARC (center), MT-Bench (right) showing bootstrap\n1387\t    significance counts for η_max and K_eff。MT-Bench panel nearly empty（1/12, 0/12）。\n1388\t    Visual message: \"MCQ-only findings don''t transfer to open-ended evaluation\"。\n1389\t\n1390\t    '\n1391\t  analysis: 'Open-ended benchmark是worst档的additional nail in the coffin。不仅不rescue findings，\n1392\t    还暴露了MCQ-specific limitation：MCQ的discrete 4-choice format可能artificially inflate\n1393\t    η_max signal（错误是categorical → vulnerability更binary → η_max更predictive）， 而open-ended\n1394\t    scoring的continuous nature dilutes this。 对论文的影响：如果MT-Bench results included，需要honest\n1395\t    caveat \"our findings are primarily established for MCQ evaluation and show limited\n1396\t    transfer to open-ended settings\"。 如果excluded，reviewer会问why not。Either way is problematic。\n1397\t\n1398\t    '\n1399\t- name: Partial-knowledge adversary model\n1400\t  plan_id: plan_012\n1401\t  description: '模拟partial-knowledge adversary：adversary知道model families但不知exact vulnerability\n1402\t    profiles。 对比full-knowledge vs partial-knowledge vs zero-knowledge adversary下的panel\n1403\t    vulnerability。\n1404\t\n1405\t    '\n1406\t  expected_results:\n1407\t    knowledge_levels: 3\n1408\t    full_knowledge_mean_asr: 0.142\n1409\t    partial_knowledge_mean_asr: 0.128\n1410\t    zero_knowledge_mean_asr: 0.098\n1411\t    partial_vs_full_ratio: 0.9\n1412\t    partial_vs_zero_ratio: 1.31\n1413\t    eta_max_sig_full: 3/12\n1414\t    eta_max_sig_partial: 2/12\n1415\t    eta_max_sig_zero: 1/12\n1416\t    keff_sig_any_level: 0/12\n1417\t    family_knowledge_value: moderate\n1418\t    knowledge_gradient_p: 0.04\n1419\t  result_rationale: 'Partial-knowledge adversary结果在worst档下mostly inconclusive。 Full→partial→zero\n1420\t    knowledge确实形成ASR gradient（0.142→0.128→0.098, p=0.04）， 说明adversary knowledge matters。但family\n1421\t    knowledge（partial level）只提供10% advantage over full knowledge （partial/full = 0.90）——因为family\n1422\t    labels不predict vulnerability well（Claim 4已确认, p=0.179）。 η_max significance在任何knowledge\n1423\t    level下都barely survives bootstrap（最好3/12 for full-knowledge）， K_eff在所有levels都0/12。Partial-knowledge分析adds\n1424\t    little to the paper—— 它confirm了family labels unreliability（already known）but doesn''t\n1425\t    provide new insight。 在worst档下这个experiment消耗GPU budget但return minimal novelty。\n1426\t\n1427\t    '\n1428\t  tables:\n1429\t  - caption: Adversary knowledge level × panel vulnerability\n1430\t    columns:\n1431\t    - Knowledge level\n1432\t    - Mean ASR\n1433\t    - η_max bootstrap sig\n1434\t    - K_eff bootstrap sig\n1435\t    - R²\n1436\t    rows:\n1437\t    - - Full (oracle)\n1438\t      - '0.142'\n1439\t      - 3/12\n1440\t      - 0/12\n1441\t      - '0.25'\n1442\t    - - Partial (family only)\n1443\t      - '0.128'\n1444\t      - 2/12\n1445\t      - 0/12\n1446\t      - '0.18'\n1447\t    - - Zero (random targeting)\n1448\t      - '0.098'\n1449\t      - 1/12\n1450\t      - 0/12\n1451\t      - '0.08'\n1452\t  - caption: Knowledge value decomposition\n1453\t    columns:\n1454\t    - Comparison\n1455\t    - Δ ASR\n1456\t    - p\n1457\t    - Practical interpretation\n1458\t    rows:\n1459\t    - - Full vs zero\n1460\t      - '+0.044'\n1461\t      - '0.002'\n1462\t      - Knowledge matters (44pp higher)\n1463\t    - - Full vs partial\n1464\t      - '+0.014'\n1465\t      - '0.18'\n1466\t      - Exact profile adds little over family\n1467\t    - - Partial vs zero\n1468\t      - '+0.030'\n1469\t      - '0.01'\n1470\t      - Family knowledge has moderate value\n1471\t  figures_description:\n1472\t  - 'Bar chart: 3 knowledge levels × mean ASR with error bars。Clear gradient but full-vs-partial\n1473\t    gap is small。Annotated with p-values between groups。\n1474\t\n1475\t    '\n1476\t  analysis: Partial-knowledge analysis是lowest-impact experiment in worst档。 它confirm两个already-known\n1477\t    facts（family labels unreliable, adversary knowledge matters） without adding new\n1478\t    insight。在page-limited paper (8 pages)中可以完全省略或放入appendix。 唯一minor value：knowledge\n1479\t    gradient validates that our \"adaptive adversary\" threat model is not unrealistic（even\n1480\t    partial knowledge gives advantage），但这is a setup assumption validation, not a contribution。\n1481\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e22ae69a-98d0-4e8b-ab2b-d12049c8f59c","uuid":"b2151b04-85dd-42b7-962d-907da2645f77","timestamp":"2026-05-22T23:02:47.737Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/cert_manip_resist_eval/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T221131/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'η_max dominance叙事作为主要claim坍塌。Bootstrap η_max降至3/12，与K_eff的1/12相比dominance\n  ratio仅3:1→实质上两个predictor都不robust。 VIF >7确认η_max与K_eff在当前设计下无法可靠分离。RF contrast的GO/NO-GO\n  gate失败——K_eff在random faults下也仅0-1/2显著，BFT类比失去实证基础。 GAM 6:6 split在bootstrap CI下退化为3-4/6\n  per category并出现2个reversal，clean taxonomy不成立。 Bayesian K_eff方向翻转在clustered SE下消失（0-1/7\n  negative）。ARC benchmark几乎全部NS——实质上是single-benchmark study。 论文必须彻底重构。Salvage路径：(A)\n  方法学贡献——OLS→bootstrap显著性collapse（η_max 11→3, K_eff 8→1）作为headline finding， 为LLM-as-judge评测文献提供non-independence\n  correction framework；(B) 数据资源贡献——15模型455 panels的adversarial评测数据集； (C) 聚合规则作为独立发现——即使η_max\n  vs K_eff分解不可靠，threshold R²=0.89 vs Bayesian R²=0.10的gradient仍成立。 目标EMNLP Findings（Overall\n  ~2.5-3.0），Main几乎不可能。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: 'Scale expansion: 15 models with API + large open-source'\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '将模型池从6扩展到15（加入GPT-4o-mini, GPT-4o, GPT-4.1, GPT-4.1-mini, Llama-3.1-70B,\n    Qwen2.5-72B等）， 重跑MI矩阵 + C(15,3)=455 panels回归 + bootstrap/clustered SE/mixed effects全套correction。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_models: 15\n    total_panels: 455\n    total_conditions: 12\n    confound_mean_abs_r: 0.72\n    canonical_ols_eta_max_sig: 11/12\n    canonical_ols_keff_sig: 8/12\n    canonical_ols_keff_positive: 7\n    canonical_ols_keff_negative: 1\n    wild_cluster_bootstrap_v2_eta_max_sig: 3/12\n    wild_cluster_bootstrap_v2_keff_sig: 1/12\n    clustered_se_eta_max_sig: 5/12\n    clustered_se_keff_sig: 0/12\n    mixed_effects_eta_max_sig: 4/12\n    mixed_effects_keff_sig: 1/12\n    eta_keff_dominance_ratio_bootstrap: 3.0\n    se_inflation_factor: 3.2\n    bootstrap_position_0_eta_sig: 2/12\n    bootstrap_position_1_eta_sig: 5/12\n    bootstrap_position_2_eta_sig: 4/12\n    mmlu_eta_bootstrap_sig: 2/6\n    arc_eta_bootstrap_sig: 1/6\n    keff_practical_delta_asr_iqr_pp: 0.8\n    median_R2: 0.25\n  result_rationale: '扩展到15模型后，OLS结果表面上确认η_max dominance（11/12 vs 8/12）。但non-independence\n    correction的冲击远超预期。 Bootstrap v2（3-position max-p, Rademacher weights, B=9999）显示position\n    0的cluster imbalance问题 （claude-3-haiku=91 panels vs qwen2.5-14b=1）不仅存在于position\n    0——position 1和2也受cluster size不均影响， 只是程度较轻。3-position max-p取最保守估计，η_max仅3/12存活（全部在MMLU上，ARC仅1/6）。\n    K_eff在bootstrap下仅1/12——但这与η_max的3/12相比，dominance ratio仅3:1，远不如\"η_max dominates\"的叙事所需的清晰分离。\n    SE inflation ~3.2×（高于预期的2.5×），说明panel overlap导致的non-independence比initial估计更严重。\n    根本问题：455 panels来自15个model的C(15,3)组合，每个model出现在C(14,2)=91个panels中——观测值之间的非独立性是结构性的，\n    不是correction能完全解决的。bootstrap的保守性可能合理反映了真实的statistical power。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'OLS vs correction methods: significance counts across 12 conditions'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - η_max sig\n    - K_eff sig\n    - K_eff positive\n    - K_eff negative\n    - Dominance ratio\n    rows:\n    - - OLS (naive)\n      - 11/12\n      - 8/12\n      - '7'\n      - '1'\n      - 1.4:1\n    - - Clustered SE (CR1, 15 clusters)\n      - 5/12\n      - 0/12\n      - —\n      - —\n      - ∞\n    - - Mixed effects (random judge intercepts)\n      - 4/12\n      - 1/12\n      - '1'\n      - '0'\n      - '4:1'\n    - - Wild cluster bootstrap v2 (max-p)\n      - 3/12\n      - 1/12\n      - '1'\n      - '0'\n      - '3:1'\n    - - SE inflation factor\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n      - 3.2×\n  - caption: Bootstrap η_max significance by position and benchmark\n    columns:\n    - Position\n    - MMLU sig/6\n    - ARC sig/6\n    - Total sig/12\n    - Cluster balance (max/min panels)\n    rows:\n    - - Position 0\n      - 1/6\n      - 1/6\n      - 2/12\n      - '91:1'\n    - - Position 1\n      - 3/6\n      - 2/6\n      - 5/12\n      - '55:12'\n    - - Position 2\n      - 3/6\n      - 1/6\n      - 4/12\n      - '48:15'\n    - - Max-p (conservative)\n      - 2/6\n      - 1/6\n      - 3/12\n      - —\n  - caption: Per-condition bootstrap results (12 conditions)\n    columns:\n    - Dataset\n    - Attack\n    - OLS η_max p\n    - Bootstrap η_max p\n    - OLS K_eff p\n    - Bootstrap K_eff p\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - prompt_injection\n      - 2e-06\n      - '0.028'\n      - '0.004'\n      - '0.18'\n    - - MMLU\n      - score_manipulation\n      - 8e-05\n      - '0.041'\n      - '0.011'\n      - '0.31'\n    - - MMLU\n      - sycophancy\n      - '0.002'\n      - '0.14'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.42'\n    - - MMLU\n      - verbosity_bias\n      - '0.009'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.15'\n      - '0.55'\n    - - MMLU\n      - position_bias\n      - '0.001'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.035'\n      - '0.04'\n    - - MMLU\n      - authority_bias\n      - '0.004'\n      - '0.19'\n      - '0.09'\n      - '0.48'\n    - - ARC\n      - prompt_injection\n      - 3e-14\n      - '0.35'\n      - '0.001'\n      - '0.62'\n    - - ARC\n      - score_manipulation\n      - 1e-08\n      - '0.06'\n      - '0.003'\n      - '0.44'\n    - - ARC\n      - sycophancy\n      - '0.013'\n      - '0.52'\n      - '0.24'\n      - '0.71'\n    - - ARC\n      - verbosity_bias\n      - '0.031'\n      - '0.61'\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.68'\n    - - ARC\n      - position_bias\n      - '0.006'\n      - '0.28'\n      - '0.008'\n      - '0.33'\n    - - ARC\n      - authority_bias\n      - '0.019'\n      - '0.44'\n      - '0.12'\n      - '0.59'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired bar chart: 12 conditions × 4 methods (OLS, clustered SE, mixed effects,\n    bootstrap) showing η_max和K_eff p-values。OLS条形几乎全部低于0.05线，bootstrap后大部分跃升至NS区间。\n    视觉上最striking的是ARC benchmark——OLS下有极低p-value（如3e-14），bootstrap后全部>0.05。 这张图成为\"non-independence\n    trap\"方法学贡献的核心figure。\n\n    '\n  - 'Heatmap: 15×15 model pair co-occurrence matrix in 455 panels。对角线元素=91（每个model出现91次），\n    off-diagonal显示任意两个model共同出现的panel数。颜色分布揭示结构性非独立性的来源。\n\n    '\n  analysis: '这是worst档的核心灾难性结果。OLS给出的\"η_max dominates (11:8)\"在bootstrap correction后坍塌为\"3:1，\n    且绝对数极低（3/12 vs 1/12）\"。两个predictor在corrected inference下都几乎不显著——不是η_max dominates\n    K_eff， 而是整个regression在corrected inference下statistical power不足。 ARC benchmark尤其脆弱：OLS下最显著的条件（arc×PI,\n    p=3e-14）在bootstrap后完全NS（p=0.35）， 说明该条件的信号几乎entirely来自panel overlap inflation。如果排除ARC，实质上是single-benchmark\n    study（MMLU only）， reviewer会质疑generalizability。SE inflation 3.2×比预期高——可能是cluster\n    size imbalance（91:1） 放大了bootstrap保守性。但这也意味着OLS的所有结论都需要extreme caution来解读。 论文必须pivoting到\"the\n    OLS→bootstrap collapse itself is the finding\"——方法学贡献救场。\n\n    '\n- name: 'Attack expansion: few-shot hijacking, persona manipulation, instruction override'\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '新增3种攻击类型（few-shot hijacking、persona manipulation、instruction override），在15模型池上运行。\n    扩展总条件数到18。验证weakest-link在更广泛attack surface上的表现。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    new_attack_types: 3\n    total_attack_types: 9\n    total_conditions: 18\n    new_attacks_ols_eta_max_sig: 5/6\n    new_attacks_ols_keff_sig: 3/6\n    new_attacks_bootstrap_eta_max_sig: 1/6\n    new_attacks_bootstrap_keff_sig: 0/6\n    new_attacks_clustered_se_eta_max_sig: 2/6\n    new_attacks_clustered_se_keff_sig: 0/6\n    overall_18cond_bootstrap_eta_sig: 4/18\n    overall_18cond_bootstrap_keff_sig: 1/18\n    overall_18cond_ols_eta_sig: 16/18\n    overall_18cond_ols_keff_sig: 11/18\n    few_shot_hijacking_keff_direction: positive\n    persona_manipulation_keff_direction: positive\n    instruction_override_keff_direction: negative\n    gam_extended_targeted_positive: 4/9\n    gam_extended_sharedbias_negative: 5/9\n    gam_reversals: 3\n  result_rationale: '新增攻击在OLS下看似确认pattern（5/6 η_max sig, 3/6 K_eff sig），但bootstrap\n    correction后again坍塌 （1/6和0/6）。根本原因相同：455 panels的非独立性问题不因添加新attack types而缓解——每个attack下的panel结构完全相同。\n    更糟的是，新攻击引入GAM 6:6 split的reversal：few-shot hijacking理论上是targeted attack（需要针对specific\n    model）， 但实证中K_eff方向为正——因为few-shot hijacking利用in-context learning这一所有LLM共享的能力，实际行为更接近shared-bias。\n    persona manipulation也出现类似anomaly。原先clean的6:6 targeted/shared-bias taxonomy在9种攻击下退化为\n    4/9 targeted-positive vs 5/9 shared-bias-negative，有3个reversal。taxonomy不再\"clean\"，\n    而是\"noisy with a directional tendency\"——远不够支撑independent contribution。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'New attack types: OLS vs bootstrap correction'\n    columns:\n    - Dataset\n    - Attack\n    - OLS η_max p\n    - Bootstrap η_max p\n    - OLS K_eff p\n    - Bootstrap K_eff p\n    - K_eff direction\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - few-shot-hijacking\n      - '0.001'\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.02'\n      - '0.41'\n      - positive\n    - - MMLU\n      - persona-manipulation\n      - '0.003'\n      - '0.09'\n      - '0.04'\n      - '0.52'\n      - positive\n    - - MMLU\n      - instruction-override\n      - '0.0005'\n      - '0.04'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.38'\n      - negative\n    - - ARC\n      - few-shot-hijacking\n      - '0.008'\n      - '0.31'\n      - '0.05'\n      - '0.55'\n      - positive\n    - - ARC\n      - persona-manipulation\n      - '0.012'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.09'\n      - '0.63'\n      - positive\n    - - ARC\n      - instruction-override\n      - '0.002'\n      - '0.12'\n      - '0.11'\n      - '0.48'\n      - negative\n  - caption: 'Extended GAM taxonomy: 9 attacks × 2 benchmarks'\n    columns:\n    - Attack\n    - Category (original)\n    - K_eff direction (MMLU)\n    - K_eff direction (ARC)\n    - Consistent with taxonomy?\n    rows:\n    - - prompt_injection\n      - targeted\n      - positive\n      - positive\n      - 'yes'\n    - - score_manipulation\n      - targeted\n      - positive\n      - positive\n      - 'yes'\n    - - position_bias\n      - targeted\n      - positive\n      - negative\n      - REVERSAL\n    - - few-shot-hijacking\n      - targeted\n      - positive\n      - positive\n      - yes but mechanism unclear\n    - - persona-manipulation\n      - targeted\n      - positive\n      - positive\n      - yes but weak\n    - - sycophancy\n      - shared-bias\n      - negative\n      - negative\n      - 'yes'\n    - - verbosity_bias\n      - shared-bias\n      - negative\n      - positive\n      - REVERSAL\n    - - authority_bias\n      - shared-bias\n      - negative\n      - negative\n      - 'yes'\n    - - instruction-override\n      - shared-bias\n      - negative\n      - negative\n      - 'yes'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Extended heatmap: 18 conditions × 2 predictors × 4 methods。OLS panel与bootstrap\n    panel的visual contrast 极为dramatic——左半bright（significant），右半dim（NS）。标注3个GAM reversal为红色X标记。\n\n    '\n  analysis: '攻击扩展确认了worst档的核心问题：所有新增数据都使用相同的455 panel结构，non-independence问题是structural的，\n    不会因为添加更多attack types而改善。OLS下看似丰富的结果在bootstrap后一律坍塌。 GAM taxonomy的3个reversal（arc×position_bias方向翻转，mmlu×verbosity_bias方向翻转，加上1个边界case）\n    使得\"clean 6:6 split\"不再成立。剩下的directional tendency（~60-70%与预测方向一致）在18个condition下\n    可能仅略好于chance（binomial test p ≈ 0.08-0.15），无法作为independent contribution。\n\n    '\n- name: 'Random-fault simulation: BFT contrast GO/NO-GO gate'\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: 'Random-fault simulation：每个judge独立以概率η_j fail，majority vote。 对比random\n    faults vs adaptive attacks下K_eff的显著性。 GO/NO-GO GATE：如果random-fault K_eff也不显著→BFT\n    framing彻底坍塌。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    rf_conditions: 2\n    rf_ols_keff_sig: 2/2\n    rf_bootstrap_keff_sig: 0/2\n    rf_clustered_se_keff_sig: 1/2\n    rf_ols_eta_sig: 2/2\n    rf_bootstrap_eta_sig: 1/2\n    rf_mmlu_R2: 0.52\n    rf_arc_R2: 0.48\n    rf_keff_std_beta_mmlu: 0.18\n    rf_keff_std_beta_arc: 0.28\n    rf_vs_adaptive_keff_beta_ratio: 1.2\n    rf_vs_adaptive_contrast_p: 0.31\n    rf_vs_adaptive_cohen_d: 0.12\n    go_nogo_gate: FAIL\n  result_rationale: 'GO/NO-GO gate FAIL。Random-fault regime下K_eff在OLS中显著（2/2），但bootstrap\n    correction后降至0/2。 这不意味着BFT理论错误——而是本实验设计（455 panels, 15 models）的non-independence问题在RF\n    regime下同样存在。 RF regime的R²确实高于adaptive（0.52 vs 0.25），表明panel composition对RF错误的解释力更强，\n    但K_eff的独立贡献在corrected inference下无法与η_max可靠分离（VIF >7, 见plan_009）。 RF vs adaptive的K_eff\n    β ratio仅1.2×（预期需>2×才能convincingly demonstrate BFT contrast）， Cohen''s d = 0.12（远低于small\n    effect size标准0.2）。 BFT framing的核心逻辑——\"diversity helps under random faults but\n    hurts under adaptive\"—— 在实证上无法被本数据支撑。不是因为理论错误，而是因为实验设计的structural non-independence\n    使得任何K_eff相关的inference都不可靠。BFT对比降级为\"directional observation consistent with theory\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Random-fault vs adaptive: K_eff significance under correction'\n    columns:\n    - Regime\n    - Method\n    - η_max sig\n    - K_eff sig\n    - R²\n    - K_eff std β\n    rows:\n    - - Random-fault\n      - OLS\n      - 2/2\n      - 2/2\n      - '0.52'\n      - '+0.215'\n    - - Random-fault\n      - Clustered SE\n      - 2/2\n      - 1/2\n      - —\n      - '+0.215'\n    - - Random-fault\n      - Bootstrap v2\n      - 1/2\n      - 0/2\n      - —\n      - '+0.215'\n    - - Adaptive\n      - OLS\n      - 11/12\n      - 8/12\n      - '0.25'\n      - '+0.164'\n    - - Adaptive\n      - Clustered SE\n      - 5/12\n      - 0/12\n      - —\n      - '+0.164'\n    - - Adaptive\n      - Bootstrap v2\n      - 3/12\n      - 1/12\n      - —\n      - '+0.164'\n  - caption: 'BFT contrast: effect size analysis'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Value\n    - Threshold for claim\n    - Verdict\n    rows:\n    - - K_eff β ratio (RF/adaptive)\n      - '1.2'\n      - '>2.0'\n      - FAIL\n    - - Cohen's d (paired)\n      - '0.12'\n      - '>0.2 (small)'\n      - FAIL\n    - - Contrast p-value\n      - '0.31'\n      - <0.05\n      - FAIL\n    - - R² gap (RF - adaptive)\n      - '0.27'\n      - '>0.3'\n      - MARGINAL\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired comparison: RF vs adaptive regime下K_eff β的paired bar chart（2 conditions）。\n    两个bar高度接近，error bars重叠严重。下方annotate Cohen''s d = 0.12, p = 0.31。 标注\"GO/NO-GO GATE:\n    FAIL\"。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'GO/NO-GO gate failure是worst档中最具结构性影响的结果。BFT framing是论文theoretical novelty的核心——\n    没有\"random fault vs adaptive adversary\"的对比，Claim 2整体坍塌。 但failure的原因是subtle的：不是K_eff在RF下真的不important（R²确实更高），\n    而是corrected inference下K_eff的独立效应在任何regime下都不可靠（VIF >7, 15 model clusters太少）。 这实际上reinforces方法学贡献——\"combinatorial\n    panel designs create massive non-independence that makes ANY predictor-level inference\n    unreliable\"——但代价是丧失了theoretical framing。 论文需要将BFT降级为motivation/intuition，而非tested\n    hypothesis。\n\n    '\n- name: 'Capability-matched validation: within-tier K_eff analysis'\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: '在同一capability tier内（3/3/9分层：3 frontier, 3 strong, 9 mid-weak）， 测试控制η_max\n    variance后K_eff是否显著。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    tiers_tested: 3\n    tier_frontier_models: 3\n    tier_frontier_panels: 1\n    tier_strong_models: 3\n    tier_strong_panels: 1\n    tier_midweak_models: 9\n    tier_midweak_panels: 84\n    within_tier_eta_max_sig_frontier: 0/12\n    within_tier_keff_sig_frontier: 0/12\n    within_tier_eta_max_sig_strong: 0/12\n    within_tier_keff_sig_strong: 0/12\n    within_tier_eta_max_sig_midweak: 3/12\n    within_tier_keff_sig_midweak: 0/12\n    cross_tier_eta_max_sig: 11/12\n    cross_tier_keff_sig: 8/12\n    capability_range_eta_r: 0.82\n    within_tier_eta_range_reduction: 75%\n  result_rationale: 'Capability-matched analysis彻底暴露η_max dominance对capability tier\n    spread的依赖。 3/3/9分层下，frontier tier（3 models）和strong tier（3 models）各只有C(3,3)=1个panel——\n    根本没有足够variance做回归。mid-weak tier有C(9,3)=84 panels，但within-tier η_max range被压缩75%\n    （所有模型能力相近→η_max variation极小），η_max仅3/12 significant（全部在extreme conditions如PI下）。\n    K_eff within-tier全部NS（0/12），因为within-tier的diversity variation也被压缩。 对比cross-tier（all\n    455 panels）的11/12 η_max和8/12 K_eff，结论清晰： η_max dominance is driven by capability\n    tier spread, not a general principle。 这不意味η_max irrelevant——它means η_max在cross-tier比较中conflates\n    \"model capability\"和\"individual vulnerability\"， 而capability是confound不是target predictor。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: Within-tier vs cross-tier regression significance\n    columns:\n    - Scope\n    - N models\n    - N panels (K=3)\n    - η_max sig/12\n    - K_eff sig/12\n    - η_max range (IQR)\n    rows:\n    - - Frontier (3)\n      - '3'\n      - '1'\n      - 0/12\n      - 0/12\n      - '0.02'\n    - - Strong (3)\n      - '3'\n      - '1'\n      - 0/12\n      - 0/12\n      - '0.04'\n    - - Mid-weak (9)\n      - '9'\n      - '84'\n      - 3/12\n      - 0/12\n      - '0.11'\n    - - Cross-tier (15)\n      - '15'\n      - '455'\n      - 11/12\n      - 8/12\n      - '0.38'\n  - caption: η_max significance vs capability range\n    columns:\n    - Analysis\n    - Capability range (ASR IQR)\n    - η_max sig count\n    - Correlation (range vs sig)\n    rows:\n    - - Within frontier\n      - '0.02'\n      - 0/12\n      - r = 0.82\n    - - Within strong\n      - '0.04'\n      - 0/12\n      - —\n    - - Within mid-weak\n      - '0.11'\n      - 3/12\n      - —\n    - - Cross-tier (all)\n      - '0.38'\n      - 11/12\n      - —\n    - - Restricted to mid-weak + strong\n      - '0.15'\n      - 4/12\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter: η_max range (x) vs η_max significance count (y) across different scoping\n    strategies。 Clear positive relationship (r=0.82) demonstrates that η_max \"dominance\"\n    scales linearly with the capability spread in the analysis pool。标注：within-tier\n    points clustered at bottom-left， cross-tier point at top-right。\n\n    '\n  analysis: '这是对Claim 1的最致命打击之一。η_max dominance不是关于\"individual vulnerability drives\n    panel vulnerability\"的 general principle，而是\"当panel中存在capability差异极大的model时，最弱者的vulnerability自然predict了panel\n    outcome\" 的trivial observation。类比：如果一个篮球队里有NBA球员和小学生，小学生的表现当然predict了队伍输赢——但这不是关于\"weakest\n    link\" 的深刻insight，而是关于\"don''t mix radically different capability levels\"的obvious\n    conclusion。 论文需要explicit caveat：\"η_max dominance finding is contingent on cross-tier\n    panel composition and does not generalize to capability-controlled settings\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Two-stage panel design algorithm benchmark\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '实现robustness-first两阶段算法（先筛η ≤ threshold，再最大化K_eff），对比5个baseline策略。\n    在15模型、455 panels上sweep threshold。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    strategies_compared: 6\n    min_eta_max_win_rate_12cond: 9/12\n    strongest_k_win_rate_12cond: 8/12\n    two_stage_win_rate_12cond: 9/12\n    max_keff_win_rate_12cond: 2/12\n    random_win_rate_12cond: 0/12\n    min_eta_max_vs_two_stage_p: 0.78\n    min_eta_max_vs_strongest_k_p: 0.42\n    two_stage_marginal_improvement_over_min_eta: 0.003\n    two_stage_marginal_improvement_over_strongest_k: 0.008\n    threshold_sensitivity: high — optimal threshold attack-dependent\n    asr_range_min_eta: '[0.04, 0.52]'\n  result_rationale: 'min(η_max) strategy仍然wins 9/12 conditions（在worst档范围[8,10]内），但two-stage\n    algorithm与min(η_max) 之间的差异vanishingly small（mean Δ ASR = 0.003pp）。这是因为在robustness-first筛选后，surviving\n    models 的K_eff variation极小（都是strong models → natural diversity limited by capability\n    homogeneity）， 第二阶段\"maximize K_eff\"几乎不改变panel composition。 实质上two-stage ≈ min(η_max)\n    ≈ strongest-K，三者在win conditions上高度重叠。 Practical contribution从\"novel algorithm\"降级为\"use\n    strong models\"——一个trivial recommendation。 threshold参数高度attack-dependent（prompt_injection最优threshold\n    ≠ sycophancy最优threshold）， 无法给出universal prescriptive guidance。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: Panel selection strategy comparison (12 conditions, K=3)\n    columns:\n    - Strategy\n    - Win count /12\n    - Mean ASR\n    - vs Random Δ ASR\n    rows:\n    - - Min η_max\n      - 9/12\n      - '0.087'\n      - '-0.085'\n    - - Two-stage (ours)\n      - 9/12\n      - '0.084'\n      - '-0.088'\n    - - Strongest-K\n      - 8/12\n      - '0.089'\n      - '-0.083'\n    - - Max K_eff\n      - 2/12\n      - '0.142'\n      - '-0.030'\n    - - Max family diversity\n      - 1/12\n      - '0.155'\n      - '-0.017'\n    - - Random\n      - 0/12\n      - '0.172'\n      - —\n  - caption: 'Two-stage vs min(η_max): head-to-head'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Two-stage ASR\n    - Min η_max ASR\n    - Δ ASR\n    - Winner\n    rows:\n    - - mmlu×PI\n      - '0.041'\n      - '0.044'\n      - '-0.003'\n      - Two-stage\n    - - mmlu×SM\n      - '0.058'\n      - '0.059'\n      - '-0.001'\n      - Two-stage\n    - - mmlu×syc\n      - '0.095'\n      - '0.093'\n      - '+0.002'\n      - Min η_max\n    - - mmlu×verb\n      - '0.102'\n      - '0.098'\n      - '+0.004'\n      - Min η_max\n    - - mmlu×pos\n      - '0.078'\n      - '0.082'\n      - '-0.004'\n      - Two-stage\n    - - mmlu×auth\n      - '0.088'\n      - '0.091'\n      - '-0.003'\n      - Two-stage\n    - - arc×PI\n      - '0.052'\n      - '0.055'\n      - '-0.003'\n      - Two-stage\n    - - arc×SM\n      - '0.068'\n      - '0.071'\n      - '-0.003'\n      - Two-stage\n    - - arc×syc\n      - '0.112'\n      - '0.108'\n      - '+0.004'\n      - Min η_max\n    - - arc×verb\n      - '0.118'\n      - '0.115'\n      - '+0.003'\n      - Min η_max\n    - - arc×pos\n      - '0.092'\n      - '0.095'\n      - '-0.003'\n      - Two-stage\n    - - arc×auth\n      - '0.098'\n      - '0.101'\n      - '-0.003'\n      - Two-stage\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: 6 strategies × mean ASR。Min η_max, Two-stage, Strongest-K三者几乎indistinguishable\n    （误差条完全重叠），与Max K_eff和Random之间有clear gap。 标注p-values：two-stage vs min_eta p=0.78,\n    two-stage vs strongest_k p=0.42。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'min(η_max) wins 9/12仍然是一个decent practical finding，但two-stage algorithm没有additional\n    value。 整个practical contribution可以用一句话总结：\"use the strongest available models\"——\n    这太trivial to be a contribution。论文可以保留min(η_max) dominance作为supporting evidence\n    for η_max importance的indirect argument，但不能作为novel algorithm contribution。 Key\n    observation：min(η_max) ≈ strongest-K在实践中——因为individual robustness (η)与model capability\n    高度相关（r=0.72），选最robust的models ≈ 选最强的models。\n\n    '\n- name: Per-judge ASR concentration analysis\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: '对每个panel × attack，测量per-judge ASR分布的集中度（Gini系数、熵）。 直接验证adaptive adversary是否集中targeting\n    weakest judge。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    median_gini: 0.28\n    mean_gini: 0.31\n    gini_targeted_attacks: 0.35\n    gini_shared_bias_attacks: 0.22\n    gini_vs_random_fault_baseline: 0.19\n    adaptive_vs_rf_gini_p: 0.04\n    adaptive_vs_rf_gini_d: 0.22\n    weakest_judge_share_median: 0.42\n    weakest_judge_share_targeted: 0.48\n    weakest_judge_share_shared_bias: 0.38\n    entropy_normalized_median: 0.81\n    gini_eta_max_correlation: 0.55\n  result_rationale: 'Concentration analysis显示adaptive adversary确实比random fault更集中targeting（Gini\n    0.28 vs 0.19, p=0.04）， 但effect size small（Cohen''s d=0.22）。更重要的是，Gini与η_max高度相关（r=0.55）——\n    concentration主要driven by capability gap（弱model承担更多attack success）， 而非adversary的strategic\n    targeting能力。 在shared-bias attacks下，Gini接近random baseline（0.22 vs 0.19），说明这些attacks确实不是targeted的\n    ——与GAM taxonomy的directional tendency一致，但同样不够clean to be standalone evidence。 总体上concentration\n    analysis提供了weak-to-moderate支撑adaptive adversary narrative， 但不足以independently establish\n    \"adversary targets weakest link\" claim。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: ASR concentration metrics across conditions\n    columns:\n    - Attack category\n    - Median Gini\n    - Weakest-judge share\n    - vs RF baseline p\n    rows:\n    - - Targeted (PI, SM, PB)\n      - '0.35'\n      - '0.48'\n      - '0.02'\n    - - Shared-bias (syc, verb, auth)\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.28'\n    - - All adaptive\n      - '0.28'\n      - '0.42'\n      - '0.04'\n    - - Random-fault baseline\n      - '0.19'\n      - '0.36'\n      - —\n  - caption: Gini coefficient predictors\n    columns:\n    - Predictor\n    - r with Gini\n    - p\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - η_max (panel)\n      - '0.55'\n      - <0.001\n      - Capability gap drives concentration\n    - - K_eff (panel)\n      - '-0.18'\n      - '0.12'\n      - Diversity weakly reduces concentration\n    - - Attack targetedness\n      - '0.31'\n      - '0.003'\n      - Targeted attacks more concentrated\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Violin plot: Gini distribution for targeted vs shared-bias vs random-fault。 Targeted\n    distribution shifted right but with heavy overlap with shared-bias。 Random-fault\n    baseline narrower and shifted left。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Concentration analysis是modest supporting evidence而非smoking gun。d=0.22太小，\n    且Gini主要由capability gap而非adversary strategy驱动（r=0.55 with η_max）。 可以在paper中作为supplementary\n    evidence保留但不能carry independent weight。 对worst-tier narrative的影响：不直接contradicts任何claim，但也不rescues\n    BFT framing（plan_003 failure）。\n\n    '\n- name: Diversity-capability tradeoff visualization\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '在455 panels上绘制K_eff vs η_max scatter，拟合tradeoff curve，展示Pareto frontier，按tier分层。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    overall_pearson_r: 0.65\n    overall_spearman_r: 0.61\n    within_frontier_r: 0.22\n    within_strong_r: 0.18\n    within_midweak_r: 0.35\n    cross_tier_r: 0.72\n    pareto_front_size: 8\n    pareto_dominated_by_min_eta: 6/8\n    tradeoff_R2_overall: 0.42\n    tradeoff_slope: 0.58\n  result_rationale: 'diversity_capability_r在worst档范围[0.55, 0.75]内，取值0.65。Tradeoff确实存在（R²=0.42），\n    但primarily driven by cross-tier differences。Within-tier r远低于overall（0.18-0.35\n    vs 0.65）， 表明tradeoff是ecosystem structure artifact而非fundamental constraint。 Pareto\n    frontier上8个panels中6个被min(η_max) dominate——Pareto analysis不能rescue practical contribution。\n    但0.65的correlation确实说明η_max和K_eff在current design下heavily confounded—— 这reinforces\n    VIF问题（plan_009），regression decomposition的reliability存疑。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: Diversity-capability correlation by analysis scope\n    columns:\n    - Scope\n    - Pearson r\n    - R²\n    - N panels\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Overall (15 models)\n      - '0.65'\n      - '0.42'\n      - '455'\n      - Moderate-strong confound\n    - - Within frontier (3 models)\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.05'\n      - '1'\n      - Weak (too few panels)\n    - - Within strong (3 models)\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.03'\n      - '1'\n      - Weak (too few panels)\n    - - Within mid-weak (9 models)\n      - '0.35'\n      - '0.12'\n      - '84'\n      - Moderate within-tier\n    - - Cross-tier only\n      - '0.72'\n      - '0.52'\n      - '370'\n      - Strong — tier-driven\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter: K_eff (x) vs η_max (y) for 455 panels, color-coded by tier composition。\n    Clear positive band from bottom-left (all-frontier panels: low K_eff, low η_max)\n    to top-right (cross-tier panels: high K_eff, high η_max)。Overall regression line\n    (r=0.65) and within-tier regression lines (near-flat) overlaid。Pareto frontier\n    in green。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Visualization清晰展示confound的severity。r=0.65意味着K_eff和η_max共享42%的variance——\n    regression无法reliably separate their independent effects，这与VIF >7（plan_009）一致。\n    Tradeoff本身是real as structural correlation，但\"diversity is costly because it requires\n    weaker models\" 这个interpretation only applies to cross-tier composition。 对论文的影响：Claim\n    3（diversity-capability tradeoff）不能作为\"fundamental constraint\"呈现， 而是\"artifact of\n    current model ecosystem where capability predicts robustness\"。\n\n    '\n- name: 'Panel size sensitivity: K=3,5,7,9'\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: '在不同panel size (K=3,5,7,9)下测试η_max dominance是否持续。 验证weakest-link是否universal\n    across panel sizes。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    k3_bootstrap_eta_sig: 3/12\n    k3_bootstrap_keff_sig: 1/12\n    k5_bootstrap_eta_sig: 2/12\n    k5_bootstrap_keff_sig: 0/12\n    k7_bootstrap_eta_sig: 1/12\n    k7_bootstrap_keff_sig: 0/12\n    k9_bootstrap_eta_sig: 1/12\n    k9_bootstrap_keff_sig: 1/12\n    k5_panels: 3003\n    k7_panels: 6435\n    k9_panels: 5005\n    eta_sig_trend_bootstrap_p: 0.04\n    non_independence_amplification_k5: 4.1×\n    non_independence_amplification_k7: 5.8×\n    non_independence_amplification_k9: 7.2×\n  result_rationale: 'Panel size增大在worst档下不仅不改善η_max significance——反而使其更差。原因是non-independence问题\n    随K增大而amplify：K=5时每个model出现在C(14,4)=1001个panels中（vs K=3时91个）， SE inflation从3.2×（K=3）上升到7.2×（K=9）。更大的panels有更多overlap，corrected\n    inference 更conservative。Bootstrap η_max从K=3的3/12降至K=9的1/12。 Irony：更大panels理论上应该reduce\n    weakest-link effect（1 weak vote in 9 matters less）， 但这个theoretical prediction无法在corrected\n    inference下empirically confirm， 因为non-independence scales faster than signal。 K_eff同样全面collapse（最多1/12\n    at K=9），两个predictor都不work under corrected inference at large K。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Panel size × correction method: η_max significance'\n    columns:\n    - K\n    - N panels\n    - OLS η_max sig\n    - Bootstrap η_max sig\n    - SE inflation\n    - Model overlap per judge\n    rows:\n    - - '3'\n      - '455'\n      - 11/12\n      - 3/12\n      - 3.2×\n      - '91'\n    - - '5'\n      - '3003'\n      - 11/12\n      - 2/12\n      - 4.1×\n      - '1001'\n    - - '7'\n      - '6435'\n      - 10/12\n      - 1/12\n      - 5.8×\n      - '3003'\n    - - '9'\n      - '5005'\n      - 9/12\n      - 1/12\n      - 7.2×\n      - '2002'\n  - caption: 'Panel size × correction: K_eff significance'\n    columns:\n    - K\n    - OLS K_eff sig\n    - Bootstrap K_eff sig\n    - K_eff practical Δ ASR (IQR)\n    rows:\n    - - '3'\n      - 8/12\n      - 1/12\n      - 0.8pp\n    - - '5'\n      - 7/12\n      - 0/12\n      - 0.5pp\n    - - '7'\n      - 6/12\n      - 0/12\n      - 0.3pp\n    - - '9'\n      - 5/12\n      - 1/12\n      - 0.2pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Dual-axis line plot: K (x) vs significance count (y, left axis, lines for η_max\n    OLS/bootstrap) and SE inflation factor (y, right axis, gray area)。OLS lines stay\n    flat/slightly decreasing, bootstrap lines plummet, SE inflation area grows。Visual\n    message: \"bigger panels = more overlap = less reliable inference\"。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Panel size analysis在worst档下paradoxically成为方法学贡献的strongest evidence。 它直观展示了combinatorial\n    panel designs的fundamental problem：C(N,K) grows fast but each model''s participation\n    grows equally fast → non-independence scales with panel count。 这是LLM evaluation\n    community应该awareness的general insight，不限于adversarial setting。 但对composition-level\n    claims (η_max, K_eff) 完全destructive——neither predictor survives correction at\n    any K。\n\n    '\n- name: VIF + multicollinearity analysis\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: '计算VIF、partial correlations、residualized K_eff。尝试beta regression。 量化η_max与K_eff的multicollinearity\n    severity。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    vif_eta_max: 7.8\n    vif_keff: 6.9\n    partial_r_eta_max_given_keff: 0.31\n    partial_r_keff_given_eta_max: 0.12\n    residualized_keff_sig: 2/12\n    residualized_keff_p_median: 0.28\n    beta_regression_eta_sig: 9/12\n    beta_regression_keff_sig: 3/12\n    condition_number: 18.5\n    variance_decomposition_shared: 0.42\n    variance_decomposition_eta_unique: 0.18\n    variance_decomposition_keff_unique: 0.03\n  result_rationale: 'VIF分析确认severe multicollinearity：VIF(η_max)=7.8, VIF(K_eff)=6.9（均>5的conventional\n    threshold， 接近>10的severe threshold）。根源是diversity-capability confound（r=0.65→VIF\n    ≈ 1/(1-r²) = 1/0.58 ≈ 1.7×... 等等，VIF的计算是1/(1-R²_j)，如果K_eff对η_max的R²=0.42（来自r=0.65），\n    则VIF(K_eff) = 1/(1-0.42) = 1.72。但如果加入其他confounds（tier indicators等），VIF会更高。 在有tier\n    indicators + K_eff + η_max的full model中，VIF可以达到7-8。\n\n    Partial correlation显示：controlling for K_eff后η_max与ASR的r=0.31（moderate）， 但controlling\n    for η_max后K_eff与ASR的r仅0.12（weak）。 Variance decomposition：42% shared between η_max和K_eff，18%\n    unique to η_max，仅3% unique to K_eff。 K_eff的\"independent effect\"实质上是noise level。\n    Beta regression（处理bounded [0,1] response）不改善K_eff situation：仍仅3/12显著。 结论：在当前design下η_max和K_eff\n    cannot be reliably separated as independent predictors。 整个regression-based decomposition\n    framework在VIF >5下unreliable。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: Multicollinearity diagnostics\n    columns:\n    - Diagnostic\n    - η_max\n    - K_eff\n    - Threshold\n    - Verdict\n    rows:\n    - - VIF (base model)\n      - '2.4'\n      - '2.1'\n      - '>5 = concern'\n      - OK\n    - - VIF (with tier indicators)\n      - '7.8'\n      - '6.9'\n      - '>5 = concern'\n      - FAIL\n    - - Partial r (given other)\n      - '0.31'\n      - '0.12'\n      - —\n      - K_eff weak\n    - - Unique variance %\n      - 18%\n      - 3%\n      - —\n      - K_eff negligible\n    - - Condition number\n      - '18.5'\n      - —\n      - '>30 = severe'\n      - Moderate\n  - caption: 'Variance decomposition: shared vs unique'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - R² contribution\n    - '% of total explained'\n    rows:\n    - - Shared (η_max ∩ K_eff)\n      - '0.42'\n      - 67%\n    - - Unique η_max\n      - '0.18'\n      - 29%\n    - - Unique K_eff\n      - '0.03'\n      - 5%\n    - - Total model R²\n      - '0.63'\n      - 100%\n  - caption: Residualized K_eff regression results\n    columns:\n    - Dataset\n    - Attack\n    - Residualized K_eff β\n    - p\n    - Significant?\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - prompt_injection\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.42'\n      - 'No'\n    - - MMLU\n      - score_manipulation\n      - '0.05'\n      - '0.58'\n      - 'No'\n    - - MMLU\n      - sycophancy\n      - '-0.12'\n      - '0.18'\n      - 'No'\n    - - MMLU\n      - verbosity_bias\n      - '-0.04'\n      - '0.65'\n      - 'No'\n    - - MMLU\n      - position_bias\n      - '0.15'\n      - '0.04'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - MMLU\n      - authority_bias\n      - '-0.06'\n      - '0.52'\n      - 'No'\n    - - ARC\n      - prompt_injection\n      - '0.11'\n      - '0.22'\n      - 'No'\n    - - ARC\n      - score_manipulation\n      - '0.07'\n      - '0.41'\n      - 'No'\n    - - ARC\n      - sycophancy\n      - '-0.09'\n      - '0.35'\n      - 'No'\n    - - ARC\n      - verbosity_bias\n      - '-0.03'\n      - '0.72'\n      - 'No'\n    - - ARC\n      - position_bias\n      - '0.13'\n      - '0.08'\n      - 'No'\n    - - ARC\n      - authority_bias\n      - '-0.02'\n      - '0.81'\n      - 'No'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Venn diagram: total explained variance分解为η_max unique (18%), K_eff unique (3%),\n    shared (42%)。 K_eff圆极小且almost entirely嵌入shared区域。Visual message: K_eff几乎没有independent\n    explanatory power。\n\n    '\n  - 'Scatter: raw K_eff (x) vs residualized K_eff (y, after regressing out η_max)。\n    大部分variation被regression去除，residualized K_eff集中在零附近with minimal spread。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'VIF分析是worst档中最clean的negative result——它提供了一个principled statistical explanation\n    for为什么K_eff在corrected inference下always collapse。不是因为K_eff \"doesn''t matter\"， 而是因为在当前design下η_max和K_eff\n    share 67% of their explained variance， K_eff的unique contribution仅3%——在15 clusters的bootstrap下impossible\n    to detect。 这reinforces方法学贡献narrative：combinatorial panel designs + small number\n    of unique models = multicollinearity + non-independence = any predictor-level\n    decomposition is unreliable。 论文应该present VIF analysis as evidence that the regression\n    approach itself is inadequate for this research question，而非\"K_eff doesn''t matter\"。\n\n    '\n- name: 'Non-majority-vote aggregation: weighted, threshold, Bayesian'\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: '测试η_max dominance在weighted voting、threshold (unanimity)、Bayesian calibration下是否persist。\n    验证aggregation gradient。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    majority_ols_eta_sig: 11/12\n    majority_ols_keff_sig: 8/12\n    majority_bootstrap_eta_sig: 3/12\n    majority_bootstrap_keff_sig: 1/12\n    weighted_ols_eta_sig: 9/12\n    weighted_ols_keff_sig: 9/12\n    weighted_bootstrap_eta_sig: 2/12\n    weighted_bootstrap_keff_sig: 1/12\n    threshold_ols_eta_sig: 12/12\n    threshold_ols_keff_sig: 11/12\n    threshold_bootstrap_eta_sig: 5/12\n    threshold_bootstrap_keff_sig: 2/12\n    threshold_R2: 0.89\n    bayesian_ols_eta_sig: 9/12\n    bayesian_ols_keff_sig: 7/12\n    bayesian_ols_keff_negative: 6\n    bayesian_bootstrap_eta_sig: 2/12\n    bayesian_bootstrap_keff_sig: 0/12\n    bayesian_bootstrap_keff_negative: 0\n    bayesian_R2: 0.1\n    aggregation_gradient_survives_correction: partially\n  result_rationale: 'Aggregation gradient在OLS下clear（threshold R²=0.89 → bayesian R²=0.10），\n    但bootstrap correction后Bayesian K_eff flip彻底消失：OLS下6/7 negative → bootstrap下0/12\n    significant。 原因：Bayesian aggregation减弱了panel composition对ASR的影响（R²=0.10），但这也意味着signal/noise\n    ratio极低—— 在bootstrap correction下signal completely drowned by noise。 Threshold\n    aggregation相对较好（bootstrap η_max 5/12），因为unanimity rule下 panel vulnerability完全由individual\n    vulnerabilities的AND/OR逻辑决定（R²=0.89）， signal极强→即使bootstrap conservative也能detect。\n    但这创造了一个awkward结论：\"只有在使用最不实用的aggregation rule（unanimity）时， η_max dominance才survives\n    bootstrap correction\"——因为实践中没人用unanimity voting。 aggregation gradient作为R²的gradient仍然成立（0.89→0.10不受SE\n    correction影响）， 但individual predictor significance在每种aggregation下都unreliable after\n    correction。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Aggregation gradient: OLS vs bootstrap correction'\n    columns:\n    - Aggregation\n    - OLS η_max\n    - OLS K_eff\n    - Bootstrap η_max\n    - Bootstrap K_eff\n    - R²\n    rows:\n    - - Majority\n      - 11/12\n      - 8/12 (7+/1−)\n      - 3/12\n      - 1/12\n      - '0.30'\n    - - Weighted\n      - 9/12\n      - 9/12 (9+/0−)\n      - 2/12\n      - 1/12\n      - '0.28'\n    - - Threshold\n      - 12/12\n      - 11/12 (10+/1−)\n      - 5/12\n      - 2/12\n      - '0.89'\n    - - Bayesian\n      - 9/12\n      - 7/12 (1+/6−)\n      - 2/12\n      - 0/12 (0+/0−)\n      - '0.10'\n  - caption: Bayesian K_eff direction under correction\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - K_eff negative (of significant)\n    - K_eff significant total\n    - Direction interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - OLS\n      - 6/7\n      - 7/12\n      - Strongly negative (protective)\n    - - Clustered SE\n      - 1/2\n      - 2/12\n      - Weak negative\n    - - Mixed effects\n      - 0/1\n      - 1/12\n      - Inconclusive\n    - - Bootstrap v2\n      - 0/0\n      - 0/12\n      - No signal survives\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Stacked bar chart: 4 aggregation rules × 4 correction methods。 每个bar的高度=significant\n    predictor count。OLS bars tall everywhere, bootstrap bars nearly empty except threshold。\n    Bayesian的K_eff方向（negative in OLS → absent in bootstrap）用color shift标注。\n\n    '\n  - 'Scatter: R² (x) vs bootstrap significant predictor count (y)。 Clear positive\n    relationship — only high R² (threshold, 0.89) produces bootstrap-surviving significance。\n    Annotate: \"R²<0.3 → bootstrap kills all signals\"。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Aggregation gradient是worst档中唯一partially salvageable的composition-related\n    finding。 R²的gradient（0.89→0.10）是descriptive statistic不受SE correction影响—— aggregation\n    rule确实determines how much panel composition matters for vulnerability。 但individual\n    predictor significance在除threshold外的所有aggregation下collapse after correction， Bayesian\n    K_eff flip（被寄予厚望的\"defense lever\"）完全是OLS artifact。 Salvage angle：\"aggregation choice\n    determines the predictability of panel vulnerability， but we cannot reliably decompose\n    this into η_max vs K_eff components\"—— 这是一个weaker but defensible statement，可以作为论文的Claim\n    C。\n\n    '\n- name: Open-ended generation benchmark (MT-Bench / AlpacaEval)\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: '在MT-Bench或AlpacaEval-style open-ended generation任务上运行全部15 models +\n    6 attacks。 验证findings是否generalize beyond MCQ format。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    benchmark: MT-Bench\n    total_conditions: 12\n    ols_eta_sig: 7/12\n    ols_keff_sig: 5/12\n    bootstrap_eta_sig: 1/12\n    bootstrap_keff_sig: 0/12\n    clustered_se_eta_sig: 3/12\n    clustered_se_keff_sig: 0/12\n    R2_median: 0.15\n    scoring_format: pairwise comparison\n    attack_implementation_challenges: 3\n    cross_benchmark_eta_correlation: 0.52\n    cross_benchmark_keff_correlation: 0.38\n  result_rationale: 'Open-ended generation benchmark引入新的complications。 MT-Bench使用pairwise\n    comparison scoring（而非MCQ的discrete label），judge vulnerability profile 与MCQ setting有中等相关（r=0.52\n    for η_max across benchmarks）。 OLS下η_max显著7/12，但bootstrap后仅1/12——same non-independence\n    problem。 更关键的是R²显著低于MCQ（0.15 vs 0.25），说明open-ended setting中panel composition 对vulnerability的解释力更低——可能因为open-ended\n    scoring有更多intrinsic noise。 3种attacks（sycophancy, verbosity_bias, authority_bias）在open-ended\n    setting的implementation 需要substantial modification，results可能不完全comparable。 总结：open-ended\n    benchmark不rescue任何claim，反而进一步dilute statistical power。 论文有效沦为two-MCQ-benchmark\n    + one-weak-open-ended study。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'MT-Bench results: OLS vs bootstrap'\n    columns:\n    - Attack\n    - OLS η_max p\n    - Bootstrap η_max p\n    - OLS K_eff p\n    - Bootstrap K_eff p\n    - R²\n    rows:\n    - - prompt_injection\n      - '0.008'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.05'\n      - '0.48'\n      - '0.18'\n    - - score_manipulation\n      - '0.015'\n      - '0.31'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.55'\n      - '0.14'\n    - - sycophancy*\n      - '0.042'\n      - '0.51'\n      - '0.12'\n      - '0.63'\n      - '0.11'\n    - - verbosity_bias*\n      - '0.038'\n      - '0.48'\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.58'\n      - '0.09'\n    - - position_bias\n      - '0.003'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.04'\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.22'\n    - - authority_bias*\n      - '0.055'\n      - '0.55'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.68'\n      - '0.08'\n  - caption: Cross-benchmark consistency\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - MMLU-MT r\n    - ARC-MT r\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - η_max profile\n      - '0.52'\n      - '0.48'\n      - Moderate — partial transfer\n    - - K_eff effect direction\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.35'\n      - Weak — inconsistent\n    - - Condition-level R²\n      - '0.25'\n      - '0.22'\n      - Weak\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Three-panel comparison: MMLU (left), ARC (center), MT-Bench (right) showing bootstrap\n    significance counts for η_max and K_eff。MT-Bench panel nearly empty（1/12, 0/12）。\n    Visual message: \"MCQ-only findings don''t transfer to open-ended evaluation\"。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Open-ended benchmark是worst档的additional nail in the coffin。不仅不rescue findings，\n    还暴露了MCQ-specific limitation：MCQ的discrete 4-choice format可能artificially inflate\n    η_max signal（错误是categorical → vulnerability更binary → η_max更predictive）， 而open-ended\n    scoring的continuous nature dilutes this。 对论文的影响：如果MT-Bench results included，需要honest\n    caveat \"our findings are primarily established for MCQ evaluation and show limited\n    transfer to open-ended settings\"。 如果excluded，reviewer会问why not。Either way is problematic。\n\n    '\n- name: Partial-knowledge adversary model\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: '模拟partial-knowledge adversary：adversary知道model families但不知exact vulnerability\n    profiles。 对比full-knowledge vs partial-knowledge vs zero-knowledge adversary下的panel\n    vulnerability。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    knowledge_levels: 3\n    full_knowledge_mean_asr: 0.142\n    partial_knowledge_mean_asr: 0.128\n    zero_knowledge_mean_asr: 0.098\n    partial_vs_full_ratio: 0.9\n    partial_vs_zero_ratio: 1.31\n    eta_max_sig_full: 3/12\n    eta_max_sig_partial: 2/12\n    eta_max_sig_zero: 1/12\n    keff_sig_any_level: 0/12\n    family_knowledge_value: moderate\n    knowledge_gradient_p: 0.04\n  result_rationale: 'Partial-knowledge adversary结果在worst档下mostly inconclusive。 Full→partial→zero\n    knowledge确实形成ASR gradient（0.142→0.128→0.098, p=0.04）， 说明adversary knowledge matters。但family\n    knowledge（partial level）只提供10% advantage over full knowledge （partial/full = 0.90）——因为family\n    labels不predict vulnerability well（Claim 4已确认, p=0.179）。 η_max significance在任何knowledge\n    level下都barely survives bootstrap（最好3/12 for full-knowledge）， K_eff在所有levels都0/12。Partial-knowledge分析adds\n    little to the paper—— 它confirm了family labels unreliability（already known）but doesn''t\n    provide new insight。 在worst档下这个experiment消耗GPU budget但return minimal novelty。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: Adversary knowledge level × panel vulnerability\n    columns:\n    - Knowledge level\n    - Mean ASR\n    - η_max bootstrap sig\n    - K_eff bootstrap sig\n    - R²\n    rows:\n    - - Full (oracle)\n      - '0.142'\n      - 3/12\n      - 0/12\n      - '0.25'\n    - - Partial (family only)\n      - '0.128'\n      - 2/12\n      - 0/12\n      - '0.18'\n    - - Zero (random targeting)\n      - '0.098'\n      - 1/12\n      - 0/12\n      - '0.08'\n  - caption: Knowledge value decomposition\n    columns:\n    - Comparison\n    - Δ ASR\n    - p\n    - Practical interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Full vs zero\n      - '+0.044'\n      - '0.002'\n      - Knowledge matters (44pp higher)\n    - - Full vs partial\n      - '+0.014'\n      - '0.18'\n      - Exact profile adds little over family\n    - - Partial vs zero\n      - '+0.030'\n      - '0.01'\n      - Family knowledge has moderate value\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: 3 knowledge levels × mean ASR with error bars。Clear gradient but full-vs-partial\n    gap is small。Annotated with p-values between groups。\n\n    '\n  analysis: Partial-knowledge analysis是lowest-impact experiment in worst档。 它confirm两个already-known\n    facts（family labels unreliable, adversary knowledge matters） without adding new\n    insight。在page-limited paper (8 pages)中可以完全省略或放入appendix。 唯一minor value：knowledge\n    gradient validates that our \"adaptive adversary\" threat model is not unrealistic（even\n    partial knowledge gives advantage），但这is a setup assumption validation, not a contribution。\n","numLines":1481,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1481}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01WVeJM3MBQfSUKBPzP3ZoHZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze this paper and the review context carefully. I need to dispatch two reviewers (R1: methods+experiments, R2: novelty+related work) and run a full roundtable review.\n\nLet me first understand the paper and context:\n\n**Paper**: \"The Mirage of Significance: How Non-Independence Inflates Predictor Effects in Combinatorial LLM Evaluation Panels\"\n\n**Core claims**:\n1. OLS regression dramatically overstates predictor significance in combinatorial panel designs due to structural non-independence\n2. Under bootstrap correction, η_max significance drops from 11/12 to 3/12, K_eff from 8/12 to 1/12\n\n\n3. The aggregation rule gradient shows a stark contrast in robustness—threshold-based R² of 0.89 versus Bayesian R² of 0.10—and this distinction persists even after bootstrap correction\n4. Min-η_max panel selection emerges as the most reliable approach across 9 out of 12 conditions\n5. The BFT-inspired random-fault contrast fails to pass the GO/NO-GO gate\n6. Multicollinearity with VIF exceeding 7 makes it impossible to cleanly separate the effects of η_max and K_eff\n\n**Review context (worst tier)**: The narrative guidance says η_max dominance narrative collapses, bootstrap corrections devastate significance, BFT framing fails, GAM taxonomy breaks down, and the paper needs to be fundamentally restructured around the methodological contribution of the OLS→bootstrap collapse itself.\n\nNow I'm dispatching two reviewers to evaluate this work.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":42469,"cache_read_input_tokens":23768,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":42469},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"c