# Strengths\n[Numbered list, 4-6 items]\n\n### Weaknesses\n[Numbered list, 4-8 items, with specific references to tables/sections]\n\n### Questions for Authors\n[3-5 specific questions]\n\n### Missing References / Analyses\n[If any]\n\n### Soundness: X/5\n### Excitement: X/5\n### Reproducibility: X/5\n### Overall Assessment: X.X (with justification referencing the ARR scale)\n### Confidence: X/5\n```\n\nBe rigorous but fair. Ground every criticism in specific paper content.","uuid":"ccbb2d04-c76b-4a3e-8912-74eaaf1dd65d","session_id":"e22ae69a-98d0-4e8b-ab2b-d12049c8f59c"}
