{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HvUZgraLeQkHszGeUJgsYM","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 cert_manip_resist_eval 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (30 个)\\n\\n- **plan001_step1_parallel**: PREPARING — \\n- **plan001_step1_parallel_dryrun2**: PREPARING — \\n- **plan001_step1_parallel_dryrun**: PREPARING — \\n- **plan001_step1_full_v3**: PREPARING (failed) — \\n- **plan001_step1_full_v2**: PREPARING (failed) — \\n- **plan001_step1_full**: PREPARING — \\n- **plan001_step1_dryrun3**: PREPARING — \\n- **plan001_step1_dryrun2**: PREPARING — \\n- **plan001_step1_dryrun**: PREPARING — \\n- **taxonomy-broad-spectrum**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp-step2v3-retry3**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp-step2v3-retry2**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp-step2v3-retry**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp-step2v3-regression**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp-step2-keff-contrast**: DONE (negative) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-22\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n（无）\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- plan001_step1_batched_v2（准备中）\\n- plan001_step1_batched（准备中）\\n- plan001_step1_v3（准备中）\\n- plan001_step1_throttled_v5（准备中）\\n- plan001_step1_throttled_v4（准备中）\\n- plan001_step1_throttled_v3（准备中）\\n- plan001_step1_throttled_v2（准备中）\\n- plan001_step1_throttled（准备中）\\n- plan001_step1_v2（准备中）\\n- plan001_step1_parallel_final（准备中）\\n- …另有 13 项\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **plan001_step1_full_v4** (success): Expanding from 6 to 15 models (9 API + 6 local) across 6 families and 3 capability tiers breaks the structural K_eff-η_max collinearity (r=-0.8 with 6 models). With 15 models, panels can have high K_eff (cross-family diversity) without necessarily including weak judges, enabling clean separation of diversity vs robustness effects.\\n- **taxonomy-broad-spectrum** (negative): K_eff is a significant negative predictor of panel ASR specifically for broad-spectrum attacks (verbosity bias, position bias, authority bias) that exploit shared judge biases, consistent across both MMLU and ARC datasets. This validates the attack taxonomy: targeted attacks → η_max dominates; broad-spectrum attacks → K_eff provides additional protection. ← 基于 mvp-step2v3-retry3\\n- **mvp-step2v3-retry3** (negative): Controlling for individual model robustness (η_max), higher K_eff panels have significantly lower ASR. Multi-factor regression log(ASR) ~ log(K_eff) + log(η_max) should show K_eff coefficient significantly negative. ← 基于 mvp-step2v3-retry2\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 1 / 负向 3 / 失败 3 / 共 7\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nseetacloud-rtx6000: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\n\\n## 告警\\n- mvp-step2v3-regression: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp-step2v3-retry: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp-step2v3-retry2: 训练失败 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01S1a1eQXYrK9xp4DWdr34jc","session_id":"e22ae69a-98d0-4e8b-ab2b-d12049c8f59c","uuid":"ceca1766-7ab1-46c1-af08-60c7cf8802f7","timestamp":"2026-05-22T23:04:11.612Z"}
