{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FLj2tmhNzYqy9hxWaxq9GS","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/cert_manip_resist_eval/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# cert_manip_resist_eval — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-22 21:39 UTC | 更新原因: Paper Step 5 converged (5 rounds, Overall 7/10, 0 CRITICAL). PDF visually confirmed 8 pages. Submission-ready.\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n**v5+ (D019+D021)**: η_max dominates panel vulnerability. Bootstrap (recommended for small clusters) gives 5/12 η_max, 1/12 K_eff — 5:1 ratio. K_eff fragile (0-1/12 under all corrections). GAM 6:6 split confirmed. Aggregation gradient independent.\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n**论文投稿就绪** — Step 5 写作迭代完成 (5 轮, Overall 7/10, 0 CRITICAL, 0 WARNING)\\\\n\\\\n## 校正方法对比（D021, Reviewer-verified）\\\\n| Method | η_max | K_eff | Reliability |\\\\n|--------|-------|-------|-------------|\\\\n| OLS | 11/12 | 8/12 (7+/1−) | low (inflated) |\\\\n| **Wild Bootstrap v2** | **5/12** | **1/12** | **high (recommended)** |\\\\n| Clustered SE | 8/12 | 0/12 | medium |\\\\n| Mixed Effects | 7/12 | 3/12 | medium |\\\\n| + Tier indicators | 11/12 | 5/12 | controls confound |\\\\n| GAM | 12/12 | 12/12 (6+/6−) | nonlinear |\\\\n\\\\n## 论文状态\\\\n- ✅ 主文本 8 页（PDF 视觉确认，Conclusion 在 p8 结束）\\\\n- ✅ 4 张 Figure 集成（Fig 1-3 主文本, Fig 4 Appendix）\\\\n- ✅ β 下标全文一致（β₁=K_eff, β₂=η_max）\\\\n- ✅ 方法描述与代码实现一致（3-position max-SE/max-p, 13 clusters）\\\\n- ✅ Em-dash 零残留，TODO 零残留，R² 统一 0.89\\\\n- ✅ 7 个 Appendix cross-reference 全部正确\\\\n- ✅ Appendix: A(Proof) → B(Robustness Methods) → C(Extended Analysis) → D(Panel Selection)\\\\n- ✅ 编译通过，0 undefined references, 0 critical warnings\\\\n\\\\n## 写作迭代记录\\\\n| 轮次 | Overall | CRITICAL | WARNING | 主要修复 |\\\\n|------|---------|----------|---------|---------|\\\\n| R1 | 4 | 1 (β swap) | 3 | β 下标统一 |\\\\n| R2 | 6 | 1 (clustered SE) | 2 | 方法描述修正 |\\\\n|